INSERT INTO `wprubis_postmeta` VALUES (8548,798,'_wp_attachment_metadata','a:5:{s:5:\"width\";i:901;s:6:\"height\";i:605;s:4:\"file\";s:9:\"Gabon.png\";s:5:\"sizes\";a:3:{s:6:\"medium\";a:4:{s:4:\"file\";s:17:\"Gabon-300x201.png\";s:5:\"width\";i:300;s:6:\"height\";i:201;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:9:\"image/png\";}s:9:\"thumbnail\";a:4:{s:4:\"file\";s:17:\"Gabon-150x150.png\";s:5:\"width\";i:150;s:6:\"height\";i:150;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:9:\"image/png\";}s:12:\"medium_large\";a:4:{s:4:\"file\";s:17:\"Gabon-768x516.png\";s:5:\"width\";i:768;s:6:\"height\";i:516;s:9:\"mime-type\";s:9:\"image/png\";}}s:10:\"image_meta\";a:12:{s:8:\"aperture\";s:1:\"0\";s:6:\"credit\";s:0:\"\";s:6:\"camera\";s:0:\"\";s:7:\"caption\";s:0:\"\";s:17:\"created_timestamp\";s:1:\"0\";s:9:\"copyright\";s:0:\"\";s:12:\"focal_length\";s:1:\"0\";s:3:\"iso\";s:1:\"0\";s:13:\"shutter_speed\";s:1:\"0\";s:5:\"title\";s:0:\"\";s:11:\"orientation\";s:1:\"0\";s:8:\"keywords\";a:0:{}}}'),(8549,798,'_wp_attachment_image_alt','Equipe Eres Gabon'),(8550,797,'_wp_attachment_image_alt','Panneaux solaires sur le toit d\'une de nos agences à Madagascar'),(8551,796,'_wp_attachment_image_alt','Opération \"Ship to Container\" dans le port de Duran en Afrique du Sud'),(8552,799,'is_block_prd','0'),(8553,799,'is_block_map','0'),(8554,799,'block','a:1:{i:0;s:10:\"block.text\";}'),(8555,799,'header_page_text','Websites use useful and judicious techniques to increase usability and make the site as interesting as possible for each visitor. Cookies are one of the most well-known techniques. They may be used by website owners or third parties, such as advertisers who communicate through the website you visit.'),(8556,799,'header_page_color','#4a58c1'),(8557,799,'header_page_img','153'),(8558,799,'header_page',''),(8559,799,'block_0_fields_text','<div class=\"lambdaPage\">\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n<div class=\"row\">\r\n<div class=\"col-md-10 col-12\">\r\n<h2>1. Cookies Statement</h2>\r\nCookies are small text files cached by websites on users’ computers. The information contained in the cookies may also be used to track your browsing on the various websites that use the same cookie.\r\n\r\nCookies are classified by duration and by source.\r\n\r\nWe believe it is essential to provide you with information about the cookies used on our website and their purpose. The objective is threefold: to ensure the protection of your privacy, to make our website more user-friendly and to ensure its development. The following information will allow you to learn more about the cookies used on our website and their purpose.\r\n<h2>2. Use of cookies by us</h2>\r\nWe use cookies to collect statistics on the number of visitors and save information on your preferences when you browse the websites. We use cookies to improve your use of the website when browsing.\r\n<h2>3. The different cookies and their functionalities</h2>\r\nWe use different types of cookies depending on their purpose. Below is a list of the most common cookies and a description of their purpose.\r\n\r\n<strong>3.1. Session cookies</strong>\r\n\r\nA session cookie is stored temporarily in your computer\'s memory when you browse a site. They are not stored on your computer for a long time and disappear as soon as you close your web browser.\r\n\r\n<strong>3.2. Original cookies</strong>\r\n\r\nThese cookies are installed by the website itself (the same domain as the one in the browser address bar) and can only be read by this website. These cookies are generally used to store information, such as your preferences, which will be used during your next visit to the site.\r\n\r\n<strong>3.3. Third-party cookies</strong>\r\n\r\nThird-party cookies are installed by a domain different from that which appears in the browser address bar, i.e. by an organisation other than the site owner.\r\n\r\nFor example, cookies used to collect web statistics may be third- party cookies.\r\n\r\nThird-party cookies are used to generate more in-depth investigations into the user\'s browsing habits and are considered more sensitive in terms of integrity. That’s why most web browsers allow you to change your settings so you can reject them.\r\n<h2>4. Management of cookies</h2>\r\n<strong>4.1. Display of cookies</strong>\r\n\r\nAs cookies are simple text files, they can be consulted with most text editors or text processing programs. You can click on a cookie to open it. The list below explains how to display cookies in different browsers. If you are using a different browser, consult the cookie information specific to that browser. If you are using a mobile phone, refer to its user manual for more information.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><a href=\"https://support.mozilla.org/en-US/kb/cookies-information-Websites-store-on-your-computer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Firefox</a></li>\r\n 	<li><a href=\"https://support.google.com/chrome/bin/answer.py?hl=en&amp;answer=95647&amp;topic=14666&amp;ctx=topic\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Chrome</a></li>\r\n 	<li><a href=\"http://windows.microsoft.com/en-US/internet-explorer/delete-manage-cookies\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Microsoft Edge</a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<strong>4.2. Deactivation/activation or deletion of cookies</strong>\r\n\r\nTo restrict or block cookies, you must access your browser settings.\r\n\r\nIf you do not want a website to set a cookie on your computer, your browser can be set to notify you before a cookie is set. Your browser can also be set to refuse all cookies, or only third party cookies. Similarly, you can delete any cookie already installed on your computer. Note that you will need to change the settings for each browser and computer you use separately.\r\n\r\nPlease also note that if you do not accept cookies, we will no longer be able to guarantee the proper functioning of our website. Certain features of the site may become inaccessible, or you may no longer be able to access certain websites.\r\n\r\nEach browser uses a different method to change settings. If applicable, check your browser’s help functionality to set the appropriate settings.\r\n\r\nTo disable cookies on your mobile phone, refer to the user manual for more information.\r\n<h2>5. Unexpected cookies / Other</h2>\r\nGiven the functioning of the Internet and websites, we do not always have information on cookies installed by third parties on our website. This is particularly true when our web page contains embedded elements, including text, documents, images or short films stored on a third-party site but distributed on or through our website.\r\n\r\nDo not hesitate to contact us if you encounter a cookie of this type not listed in the above list on our website. You can also contact the third-party website directly to obtain more information about the cookies installed, their purpose and their duration, but also to find out to what extent respect for your privacy is guaranteed.\r\n<h2>6. Contact</h2>\r\nThis statement may be amended periodically depending on changes to our website or cookie regulations. We may change the content of this statement and the cookies listed at any time without notice. You can check this web page for the latest version.\r\n\r\nIf you have any questions or comments, please <a href=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/en/contact-us/\">Contact us</a>\r\n\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n<footer id=\"contact\">\r\n<div class=\"container\">\r\n<div class=\"row blockContact\">\r\n<div class=\"col-lg-6 col-md-7 col-12 blockFormContact\">July 2021</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</footer>'),(8560,799,'block_0_fields',''),(8561,799,'_wp_page_template','default'),(8562,799,'_yoast_wpseo_title','Cookies - Rubis Energie, energies and bitumen distributor'),(8563,799,'_yoast_wpseo_metadesc','Consult the implementation policy and the use of cookies on the Rubis Energie website and customise your navigation.'),(8564,799,'_yoast_wpseo_meta-robots-noindex','1'),(8565,799,'_yoast_wpseo_meta-robots-nofollow','1'),(8566,799,'_edit_lock','1635933982:2'),(8567,799,'_edit_last','2'),(8568,799,'_header_page_text','field_60dad748a56be'),(8569,799,'_header_page_color','field_60dad74ca56bf'),(8570,799,'_header_page_img','field_60dad753a56c0'),(8571,799,'_header_page','field_60dad72fa56bc'),(8572,799,'_is_block_prd','field_60d9cc3911a1c'),(8573,799,'_is_block_map','field_60d9cc5011a1d'),(8574,799,'_block_0_fields_text','field_5d318356707db'),(8575,799,'_block_0_fields','field_5d31c477d5643'),(8576,799,'_block','field_5d31c1ded5632'),(8577,799,'_yoast_wpseo_estimated-reading-time-minutes',''),(8578,800,'is_block_prd','0'),(8579,800,'is_block_map','0'),(8580,800,'block','a:1:{i:0;s:10:\"block.text\";}'),(8581,800,'header_page_text','In general, you are not required to disclose your personal data when you visit our website www.rubisenergie.com'),(8582,800,'header_page_color','#4a58c1'),(8583,800,'header_page_img','153'),(8584,800,'header_page',''),(8585,800,'block_0_fields_text','<h2>Privacy policy, collection and management of personal data</h2>\r\nHowever, there is an exception to this principle. For any request for information or a reminder, you will be required to provide us with your surname, first name, telephone number and email address. This is the case when you complete the online contact form. This information is required to process your request.\r\n\r\nIn accordance with articles 38 et seq. of the French Data Protection Act and articles 15 to 22 of the General Data Protection Regulation (EU) 2016/679 of 27 April 2016, you have a right of access, modification, rectification and erasure, as well as a right to restriction of processing and a right to portability of personal data for personal data concerning you.\r\n\r\nThe data is processed by Rubis Energie on the basis of your consent, which may be withdrawn at any time by contacting Rubis Energie.\r\n\r\nFinally, certain information about you may be collected automatically when you simply browse our website, including: information about the use of our website, such as the areas you visit and the services you access, your IP address, the type of your browser and your access times.\r\n\r\nSuch information is used exclusively for internal statistical purposes, so as to improve the quality of the services offered to you. Databases are protected by the provisions of the Law of 1 July 1998 transposing Directive 96/9 of 11 March 1996 on the legal protection of databases.\r\n\r\nYou may exercise your rights by sending an e-mail to the following e-mail address: info@rubisenergie.com or by sending a letter to the Communications Department to the following address: located at “Tour Landscape” 6 Place des Degrés - 92800 Puteaux – France and accompanied by a copy of an identity document and the address to which the reply must be sent.\r\n\r\nYou have the right to lodge a complaint with the Commission Nationale Informatique et Libertés (CNIL), the supervisory authority in France responsible for compliance with personal data obligations (CNIL – 3 place de Fontenoy, TSA 80715 – 75334 PARIS CEDEX 07 - France)'),(8586,800,'block_0_fields',''),(8587,800,'_wp_page_template','default'),(8588,800,'_yoast_wpseo_title','Personal data - Rubis Energie, Energies & Bitumen distributor'),(8589,800,'_yoast_wpseo_metadesc','Browse our privacy policy from our website rubisenergie.com'),(8590,800,'_yoast_wpseo_focuskw','Données personnelles'),(8591,800,'_edit_last','2'),(8592,800,'_header_page_text','field_60dad748a56be'),(8593,800,'_header_page_color','field_60dad74ca56bf'),(8594,800,'_header_page_img','field_60dad753a56c0'),(8595,800,'_header_page','field_60dad72fa56bc'),(8596,800,'_is_block_prd','field_60d9cc3911a1c'),(8597,800,'_is_block_map','field_60d9cc5011a1d'),(8598,800,'_block_0_fields_text','field_5d318356707db'),(8599,800,'_block_0_fields','field_5d31c477d5643'),(8600,800,'_block','field_5d31c1ded5632'),(8601,800,'_yoast_wpseo_linkdex','26'),(8602,800,'_yoast_wpseo_estimated-reading-time-minutes','0'),(8603,800,'_edit_lock','1700143841:2'),(8604,801,'is_block_prd','0'),(8605,801,'is_block_map','0'),(8606,801,'block','a:1:{i:0;s:10:\"block.text\";}'),(8607,801,'header_page_text','Rubis Energie, located at “Tour Landscape” 6 Place des Degrés - 92800 Puteaux – France, is pleased to welcome you to the website www.rubisenergie.com, which it publishes and manages.'),(8608,801,'header_page_color','#4a58c1'),(8609,801,'header_page_img','153'),(8610,801,'header_page',''),(8611,801,'block_0_fields_text','The purpose of the website www.rubisenergie.com, owned by Rubis Energie, is to make information about the company and its activities accessible on the Internet.\r\n\r\nThese general terms and conditions govern the relationship between Rubis Energie and users wishing to consult the Rubis Energie website or use the services offered on all the websites of Rubis Energie and/or its subsidiaries.\r\n\r\nSpecific conditions at certain sites may supplement these general conditions.\r\n<h2>Availability of services</h2>\r\nRubis Energie undertakes to make every effort to make and maintain accessible the information available on its website.\r\n\r\nRubis Energie is subject to an obligation of due diligence and, in this respect, Rubis Energie cannot be held liable in the following cases:\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Temporary interruptions to services as part of their maintenance</li>\r\n 	<li>Temporary interruptions to services beyond the control of Rubis Energie, in particular in the event of interruptions to electricity or telecommunications services</li>\r\n 	<li>Failure or malfunction of the Internet network in the transmission of messages or documents</li>\r\n 	<li>Or any other event constituting a case of force majeure</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nFurthermore, Rubis Energie shall not be held liable for damages relating to the use of the Internet, and in particular, for the presence of any malicious computer program or any external intrusion.\r\n\r\nRubis Energie reserves the right to modify or temporarily or permanently interrupt all or part of the site, at any time, without having to inform the user beforehand.\r\n\r\nRubis Energie may not be held liable by any user or third party for the modification, suspension, or interruption of the Rubis Energie site.\r\n<h2>Intellectual property</h2>\r\nUnless expressly stated otherwise, Rubis Energie holds all intellectual property rights to all elements of the website. Any reproduction, representation, adaptation, translation, in whole or in part, of documents published on the site, for purposes other than personal and private use, is prohibited.\r\n\r\nUnless expressly stated otherwise, Rubis Energie is the owner of the rights to the trademarks mentioned on this website, which may not be reproduced for purposes other than personal and private use.\r\n<h2>Hyperlinks</h2>\r\nPages on this website may link to other sites or refer to other sites. Rubis Energie does not guarantee the content of these other sites and may not be held liable for any damage resulting from the use of the content of these sites. Links to other sites are provided only for the convenience of the user of this website.\r\n<h2>Publisher</h2>\r\nRubis Energie – S.A.S. with capital of 335,000,000 euros – 552 048 811 R.C.S. Nanterre – VAT no. Intra-community FR67 552 048 811\r\n\r\n\"Tour Landscape\" – 6, Place des Degrés – 92800 Puteaux – France\r\n\r\nTel: 01 49 01 10 10 – email: info@rubisenergie.com\r\n<h2>Publishing director</h2>\r\nGérard PAOLI\r\n<h2>Design &amp;  development</h2>\r\nAgence And – digital agency Bordeaux\r\n\r\n2 rue Marc SANGNIER, 33130 Bègles\r\n<h2>Photo credits</h2>\r\nRubis, Rubis Energie, and other subsidiaries of Rubis or Rubis Energie, Getty Images, Thinkstock, Pexels, Fotolia and Gilles DACQUIN.'),(8612,801,'block_0_fields',''),(8613,801,'_wp_page_template','default'),(8614,801,'_thumbnail_id','153'),(8615,801,'_yoast_wpseo_title','Legal notices - Rubis Energie, Energies and bitumen distributor'),(8616,801,'_yoast_wpseo_metadesc','Find all the legal notices of the Rubis Energie website, international energies and bitumen distributor.'),(8617,801,'_yoast_wpseo_focuskw','Mentions légales rubis Energie'),(8618,801,'_edit_last','2'),(8619,801,'_header_page_text','field_60dad748a56be'),(8620,801,'_header_page_color','field_60dad74ca56bf'),(8621,801,'_header_page_img','field_60dad753a56c0'),(8622,801,'_header_page','field_60dad72fa56bc'),(8623,801,'_is_block_prd','field_60d9cc3911a1c'),(8624,801,'_is_block_map','field_60d9cc5011a1d'),(8625,801,'_block_0_fields_text','field_5d318356707db'),(8626,801,'_block_0_fields','field_5d31c477d5643'),(8627,801,'_block','field_5d31c1ded5632'),(8628,801,'_yoast_wpseo_linkdex','33'),(8630,801,'_yoast_wpseo_estimated-reading-time-minutes','0'),(8631,801,'_edit_lock','1700143734:2'),(8632,802,'is_block_prd','0'),(8633,802,'is_block_map','0'),(8634,802,'_wp_page_template','tpl/actus.listing.tpl.php'),(8635,802,'_yoast_wpseo_title','News of Rubis Energie - Energies and Bitumen distributor'),(8636,802,'_yoast_wpseo_metadesc','Find in this section all the news of Rubis Energie: actions for the environment, jobs, locations, ....'),(8637,802,'_yoast_wpseo_focuskw','News'),(8638,802,'_edit_last','2'),(8639,802,'_is_block_prd','field_60d9cc3911a1c'),(8640,802,'_is_block_map','field_60d9cc5011a1d'),(8641,802,'_yoast_wpseo_linkdex','49'),(8642,802,'_yoast_wpseo_estimated-reading-time-minutes',''),(8643,802,'_edit_lock','1653301146:2'),(8984,807,'is_block_prd','1'),(8985,807,'is_block_map','0'),(8986,807,'block','a:1:{i:0;s:10:\"block.text\";}'),(8987,807,'header_page_text',''),(8988,807,'header_page_color',''),(8989,807,'header_page_img',''),(8990,807,'header_page',''),(8991,807,'block_0_fields_text','Rubis Energie\'s objective is to meet the fundamental needs of individuals and professionals in terms of energy and mobility, by ensuring the accessibility of our products in a sustainable manner through the control of the supply chain.\r\n\r\nRubis Energie offers a diversified matrix of products and services. 52% of its turnover is achieved with B2C customers as opposed to 48% with B2B customers:\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Fuels in service stations</li>\r\n 	<li>Liquefied Gases</li>\r\n 	<li>Fuels for industry</li>\r\n 	<li>Aviation fuels</li>\r\n 	<li>Marine fuels</li>\r\n 	<li>Bitumens and bituminus products</li>\r\n 	<li>Lubricants</li>\r\n 	<li>Additional products / Services</li>\r\n</ul>'),(8992,807,'block_0_fields',''),(8993,807,'_wp_page_template','default'),(8994,807,'_yoast_wpseo_meta-robots-noindex','1'),(8995,807,'_yoast_wpseo_meta-robots-nofollow','1'),(8996,807,'_edit_lock','1635870810:2'),(8997,807,'_edit_last','2'),(8998,807,'_header_page_text','field_60dad748a56be'),(8999,807,'_header_page_color','field_60dad74ca56bf'),(9000,807,'_header_page_img','field_60dad753a56c0'),(9001,807,'_header_page','field_60dad72fa56bc'),(9002,807,'_is_block_prd','field_60d9cc3911a1c'),(9003,807,'_is_block_map','field_60d9cc5011a1d'),(9004,807,'_block_0_fields_text','field_5d318356707db'),(9005,807,'_block_0_fields','field_5d31c477d5643'),(9006,807,'_block','field_5d31c1ded5632'),(9007,807,'_yoast_wpseo_estimated-reading-time-minutes',''),(9008,808,'is_block_prd','0'),(9009,808,'is_block_map','1'),(9010,808,'block',''),(9011,808,'header_page_text',''),(9012,808,'header_page_color',''),(9013,808,'header_page_img',''),(9014,808,'header_page',''),(9015,808,'gg_map',''),(9016,808,'map_title','Head office'),(9017,808,'map_text','Tour Landscape\r\n6 Place des Degrés\r\n92800 Puteaux\r\nFrance\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nPhone. +33 1 49 01 10 10\r\n\r\n&nbsp;'),(9018,808,'map_phone',''),(9019,808,'map_link',''),(9020,808,'block_form_title','Contact us'),(9021,808,'block_form_text','<div id=\"contactform\"></div>\r\nIf you have a question and you want clarification, we will be very happy to answer it.\r\n\r\nPS: Would you like to join us? Send us your application via <a href=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/en/company/join-us/\">Join us</a>.'),(9022,808,'block_form_form','981'),(9023,808,'block_form_white_bg','1'),(9024,808,'block_form',''),(9025,808,'_wp_page_template','tpl/contact.tpl.php'),(9026,808,'_thumbnail_id','371'),(9027,808,'_yoast_wpseo_title','Contact - Rubis Energie - Distributor of energies and bitumen'),(9028,808,'_yoast_wpseo_metadesc','For any request, you can contact our services by email or by phone at 01 49 01 10 10.'),(9029,808,'_yoast_wpseo_focuskw','Contact'),(9030,808,'_edit_last','2'),(9031,808,'_gg_map','field_60daeb16fa07f'),(9032,808,'_map_title','field_60daeb38fa080'),(9033,808,'_map_text','field_60daeb3ffa081'),(9034,808,'_map_phone','field_60daeb4bfa082'),(9035,808,'_map_link','field_60daeb57fa083'),(9036,808,'_block_form_title','field_604f6fad50273'),(9037,808,'_block_form_text','field_604f6fb250274'),(9038,808,'_block_form_form','field_604f6fce50275'),(9039,808,'_block_form_white_bg','field_60dac2452115a'),(9040,808,'_block_form','field_60daeb90fa084'),(9041,808,'_is_block_prd','field_60d9cc3911a1c'),(9042,808,'_is_block_map','field_60d9cc5011a1d'),(9043,808,'_yoast_wpseo_linkdex','44'),(9044,808,'_yoast_wpseo_estimated-reading-time-minutes','0'),(9045,808,'_edit_lock','1699898848:3'),(9046,809,'is_block_prd','0'),(9047,809,'is_block_map','0'),(9048,809,'block','a:2:{i:0;s:10:\"block.text\";i:1;s:10:\"block.text\";}'),(9049,809,'header_page_text',''),(9050,809,'header_page_color','#4a58c1'),(9051,809,'header_page_img','408'),(9052,809,'header_page',''),(9053,809,'block_0_fields_text','<h2><strong>\"Support &amp; Services\" activity</strong></h2>\r\n<h4><strong>(15% of turnover and 27% of operating profit)</strong></h4>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Turnover: €1 041 million</li>\r\n 	<li>Gross operating income: €177 million</li>\r\n 	<li>Current operating income: €144 million</li>\r\n 	<li>Investments: €74 million</li>\r\n 	<li>Cash flow from operations: €172 million</li>\r\n</ul>'),(9054,809,'block_0_fields',''),(9055,809,'block_1_fields_first_col','<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">Breakdown by country</h3>\r\n<img class=\"aligncenter wp-image-1094 size-full\" src=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/Support-and-services-activity-Breakdown-country-Rubis-Energie.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"540\" height=\"348\" />\r\n\r\n&nbsp;'),(9056,809,'block_1_fields_second_col',''),(9057,809,'block_2_fields_text','<h2>\"Retail &amp; Marketing\" activity</h2>\r\n5.05 million m3 distributed\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Turnover: €3,334 million</li>\r\n 	<li>Gross operating income: €370 million</li>\r\n 	<li>Current operating income: €269 million</li>\r\n 	<li>Investments: €135 million</li>\r\n 	<li>Cash flow from operations: €308 million</li>\r\n</ul>'),(9058,809,'block_1_fields_text','<hr />\r\n\r\n<h2><strong>\"Retail &amp; Marketing\" activity</strong></h2>\r\n<h4><strong>(85% of turnover and 73% of operating profit)</strong></h4>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n5 487 million m3 distributed\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Turnover: €6,061 million</li>\r\n 	<li>Gross operating income: €503 million</li>\r\n 	<li>Current operating income: €396 million</li>\r\n 	<li>Investments: €141 million</li>\r\n 	<li>Cash flow from operations: €268 million</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1944 aligncenter\" src=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/Image7-300x180.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"465\" height=\"279\" />\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1945 aligncenter\" src=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/Image8-300x180.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"463\" height=\"278\" />\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1946 aligncenter\" src=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/Image9-300x180.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"460\" height=\"276\" />\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\nThe data presented on this page relate to the 2022 financial year excluding the Rubis Energie Burundi subsidiary.\r\n\r\n<em>The full results of the Group can be found on the website:</em> <a class=\"cta green\" href=\"https://www.rubis.fr/fr/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">www.rubis.fr</a>'),(9059,809,'block_2_fields_first_col','<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">Répartition par pays</h3>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-276\" src=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/rubis-energie-distribution-pays-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"580\" height=\"359\" /></p>'),(9060,809,'block_2_fields_second_col','<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">Répartition par produit</h3>\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-277 aligncenter\" src=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/rubis-energie-distribution-produits.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"580\" height=\"359\" />'),(9061,809,'block_3_fields_text','<hr />\r\n\r\n<h2>Activité Support et Services</h2>\r\n4.7 millions de tonnes de produits transportés\r\n1.18 millions de m3 vendus (Négoce hors Groupe)\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Chiffre d’Affaires : 568 millions d’€</li>\r\n 	<li>Résultat Brut d’exploitation : 158 millions d’€</li>\r\n 	<li>Résultat Opérationnel Courant : 120 millions d’€</li>\r\n 	<li>Investissements : 84 millions d’€</li>\r\n 	<li>Capacité d’autofinancement : 140 millions d’€</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<h3>Répartition par pays</h3>\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-279\" src=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/rubis-energie-support-services-pays.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"580\" height=\"359\" />'),(9064,809,'block_3_fields_first_col','<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">Breakdown by country</h3>\r\n<img class=\"aligncenter wp-image-1095 size-full\" src=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/Retail-and-marketing-activity-Breakdown-by-country-Rubis-Energie.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"540\" height=\"355\" />\r\n\r\nThe data presented on this page relate to the 2020 financial year excluding the Rubis Energy Burundi subsidiary.\r\n\r\n<em>The full results of the Group can be found on the website:</em> <a class=\"cta green\" href=\"https://www.rubis.fr/fr/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">www.rubis.fr</a>'),(9065,809,'block_3_fields_second_col','<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">Breakdown by product</h3>\r\n<img class=\"aligncenter wp-image-1093 size-full\" src=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/Retail-and-marketing-activity-Breakdown-by-product-Rubis-Energie.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"540\" height=\"308\" />\r\n\r\n&nbsp;'),(9067,809,'_wp_page_template','default'),(9068,809,'_yoast_wpseo_title','Key figures on our activities around the world - Rubis Energie'),(9069,809,'_yoast_wpseo_metadesc','All about the annual figures (by product, activity and country) of Rubis Energie\'s 2 activities: Retail & Marketing - Support & Services.'),(9070,809,'_yoast_wpseo_focuskw','chiffres clés'),(9071,809,'_edit_last','2'),(9072,809,'_header_page_text','field_60dad748a56be'),(9073,809,'_header_page_color','field_60dad74ca56bf'),(9074,809,'_header_page_img','field_60dad753a56c0'),(9075,809,'_header_page','field_60dad72fa56bc'),(9076,809,'_is_block_prd','field_60d9cc3911a1c'),(9077,809,'_is_block_map','field_60d9cc5011a1d'),(9078,809,'_block_0_fields_text','field_5d318356707db'),(9079,809,'_block_0_fields','field_5d31c477d5643'),(9080,809,'_block_1_fields_first_col','field_5d318c36a146c'),(9081,809,'_block_1_fields_second_col','field_5d318c47a146d'),(9083,809,'_block_2_fields_text','field_5d318356707db'),(9085,809,'_block_3_fields_first_col','field_5d318c36a146c'),(9086,809,'_block_3_fields_second_col','field_5d318c47a146d'),(9088,809,'_block','field_5d31c1ded5632'),(9089,809,'_yoast_wpseo_linkdex','30'),(9090,809,'_yoast_wpseo_estimated-reading-time-minutes','0'),(9091,809,'_edit_lock','1687955258:2'),(9092,810,'is_block_prd','0'),(9093,810,'is_block_map','0'),(9094,810,'block',''),(9095,810,'header_page_text',''),(9096,810,'header_page_color',''),(9097,810,'header_page_img',''),(9098,810,'header_page',''),(9099,810,'_wp_page_template','default'),(9100,810,'_yoast_wpseo_meta-robots-noindex','1'),(9101,810,'_yoast_wpseo_meta-robots-nofollow','1'),(9102,810,'_edit_last','1'),(9103,810,'_header_page_text','field_60dad748a56be'),(9104,810,'_header_page_color','field_60dad74ca56bf'),(9105,810,'_header_page_img','field_60dad753a56c0'),(9106,810,'_header_page','field_60dad72fa56bc'),(9107,810,'_is_block_prd','field_60d9cc3911a1c'),(9108,810,'_is_block_map','field_60d9cc5011a1d'),(9109,810,'_block','field_5d31c1ded5632'),(9110,810,'_yoast_wpseo_estimated-reading-time-minutes',''),(9111,810,'_edit_lock','1635859442:2'),(9112,811,'is_block_prd','0'),(9113,811,'is_block_map','0'),(9114,811,'block','a:5:{i:0;s:10:\"block.text\";i:1;s:10:\"block.text\";i:2;s:12:\"block.slider\";i:3;s:10:\"block.text\";i:4;s:12:\"block.slider\";}'),(9115,811,'header_page_text','Rubis Energie, which historically specialised in the distribution of liquefied gas, has expanded its distribution to other energies (service station networks, aviation and marine fuels, commercial fuel oil, lubricants) and bitumens.'),(9116,811,'header_page_color','#4a58c1'),(9117,811,'header_page_img','428'),(9118,811,'header_page',''),(9119,811,'block_0_fields_text','<strong>Rubis Energie</strong> means Rubis Energie SAS, a subsidiary of the Rubis Group (*), and its subsidiaries whose two activities are the supply and distribution of energies and bitumen.\r\n\r\n<em>(*) The Rubis Group is listed on the Paris stock exchange (NYSE Euronext: compartment B);</em>\r\n\r\n<em>The Rubis Group is included in the benchmark indices: CAC Mid 60, SBF 120 – ISIN code: FR0013269123</em>\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<h2>A selective investment policy</h2>\r\nRubis Energie, which historically specialised in the distribution of liquefied gas, has expanded its distribution to other energies (service station networks, aviation and marine fuels, commercial fuel oil, lubricants) and bitumens.\r\n\r\nThe Rubis Group has always pursued a strategy of holding “niche” positions in activities that are generally neglected or neglected by integrated refining groups.\r\n\r\nRubis Energie tends to be present throughout the distribution chain, from supply to the end user. By controlling the complete supply chain (trading unit, import terminals, storage and final distribution), Rubis Energie makes the energy they need accessible to its customers for the long term.\r\n\r\nToday, the Rubis Group, which has strong commitments in terms of social and environmental responsibility, also focuses on low or no carbon activities that will enable it to reduce its carbon footprint as well as those of its service providers and customers.\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<h2>Two complementary activities:</h2>\r\n<h2>“Support  &amp;  Services” and “Retail &amp; Marketing”</h2>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<h2></h2>'),(9120,811,'block_0_fields',''),(9121,811,'block_1_fields_first_col',''),(9122,811,'block_1_fields_second_col',''),(9123,811,'block_1_fields_third_col',''),(9124,811,'block_1_fields_slider_0_image','155'),(9125,811,'block_1_fields_slider_1_image','154'),(9126,811,'block_1_fields_slider','2'),(9127,811,'block_2_fields_text','<h3><strong>L’activité Support et Services</strong></h3>\r\nComprend l’ensemble des activités d’infrastructure, de transport, d’approvisionnement et de services qui viennent en support des activités de distribution et de marketing. Elle regroupe ainsi les activités de raffinage, de négoce-approvisionnement et de transport maritime de produits pétroliers (shipping).\r\n\r\nCes activités sont globalement assurées par 5 navires en pleine propriété, dont 4 bitumiers, 9 navires affrétés en time-charter (pétroliers et GPL) et une raffinerie d’une capacité théorique annuelle de l’ordre de 800kT.'),(9128,811,'block_3_fields_slider','3'),(9129,811,'block_3_fields_slider_0_image','157'),(9130,811,'block_3_fields_slider_1_image','158'),(9131,811,'block_3_fields_slider_2_image','156'),(9132,811,'block_1_fields_text','<h3>\"Support  &amp;  Services\" activity</h3>\r\nIncludes all infrastructure, transportation, procurement and service activities that support distribution and marketing activities. It includes refining, trading-supply and shipping activities for petroleum products.\r\n\r\nThese activities are generally carried out by 10 fully owned vessels, including 5 bitumen tankers, 7 time-charter vessels (oil and liquefied gas) and a refinery with an annual theoretical capacity of around 800kT.'),(9133,811,'block_1_fields',''),(9134,811,'block_2_fields_slider_0_image','157'),(9135,811,'block_2_fields_slider_1_image','522'),(9136,811,'block_2_fields_slider_2_image','156'),(9137,811,'block_2_fields_slider','4'),(9138,811,'block_2_fields',''),(9139,811,'block_3_fields_text','<h3>“Retail &amp; Marketing” activity</h3>\r\nMainly located in Europe, the Caribbean and Africa, the Group’s strategy consists of:\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Ensuring its positioning by controlling its logistics by intervening throughout the distribution chain from supply to the end user;</li>\r\n 	<li>Controlling its investments by developing in structurally energy-importing and growing areas, with a strong position in mainly regulated markets, thereby facilitating margin stability.</li>\r\n</ul>'),(9140,811,'block_3_fields',''),(9141,811,'block_4_fields_slider_0_image','525'),(9142,811,'block_4_fields_slider_1_image','154'),(9143,811,'block_4_fields_slider','5'),(9144,811,'block_4_fields',''),(9145,811,'block_4_fields_slider_2_image','155'),(9146,811,'block_2_fields_slider_3_image','158'),(9147,811,'block_4_fields_slider_3_image','285'),(9148,811,'block_4_fields_slider_4_image','349'),(9149,811,'_wp_page_template','default'),(9150,811,'_yoast_wpseo_title','Présentation of Rubis Energie - Energies and bitumen distributor'),(9151,811,'_yoast_wpseo_metadesc','Rubis Energie, which historically specialised in the distribution of liquefied gas, has expanded its distribution to other energies (service station networks, aviation and marine fuels, commercial fuel oil, lubricants) and bitumens.'),(9152,811,'_yoast_wpseo_focuskw','Présentation'),(9153,811,'_edit_last','2'),(9154,811,'_header_page_text','field_60dad748a56be'),(9155,811,'_header_page_color','field_60dad74ca56bf'),(9156,811,'_header_page_img','field_60dad753a56c0'),(9157,811,'_