_col','<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-423\" src=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/rubis-energie-lubrifiants-2.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"540\" height=\"360\" />'),(9752,837,'block_1_fields',''),(9753,837,'block_2_fields_text','<p style=\"text-align: center;\">A range of Rubis / Vito lubricants for all domestic and professional uses.</p>'),(9754,837,'block_2_fields',''),(9755,837,'_thumbnail_id','205'),(9756,837,'_yoast_wpseo_title','Lubricants | Retail by Rubis Energie'),(9757,837,'_yoast_wpseo_metadesc','In some of its subsidiaries, Rubis Energie markets either a range of high-quality lubricants under its own brand or lubricants produced by international oil companies (Castrol, Mobil, Shell, Total) as an exclusive distributor.'),(9758,837,'_yoast_wpseo_focuskw','lubricants'),(9759,837,'_edit_lock','1635523367:2'),(9760,837,'_edit_last','2'),(9761,837,'_header_page_text','field_60dad748a56be'),(9762,837,'_header_page_color','field_60dad74ca56bf'),(9763,837,'_header_page_img','field_60dad753a56c0'),(9764,837,'_header_page','field_60dad72fa56bc'),(9765,837,'_block_0_fields_text','field_5d318356707db'),(9766,837,'_block_0_fields','field_5d31c477d5643'),(9767,837,'_block_1_fields_first_col','field_5d318c36a146c'),(9768,837,'_block_1_fields_second_col','field_5d318c47a146d'),(9769,837,'_block_1_fields','field_5d31c609d5649'),(9770,837,'_block_2_fields_text','field_5d318356707db'),(9771,837,'_block_2_fields','field_5d31c477d5643'),(9772,837,'_block','field_5d31c1ded5632'),(9773,837,'_is_block_prd','field_60d9cc3911a1c'),(9774,837,'_is_block_map','field_60d9cc5011a1d'),(9775,837,'_yoast_wpseo_linkdex','44'),(9776,837,'_yoast_wpseo_content_score','60'),(9777,837,'_yoast_wpseo_estimated-reading-time-minutes',''),(9778,838,'is_block_prd','1'),(9779,838,'is_block_map','0'),(9780,838,'block','a:3:{i:0;s:10:\"block.text\";i:1;s:12:\"block.slider\";i:2;s:10:\"block.text\";}'),(9781,838,'header_page_text','Rubis Energie\'s bitumen division is active in Africa.\r\n\r\nToday, through its subsidiaries <strong>Rubis Asphalt, ERES and ASCA</strong>, it is the leader in West Africa in the distribution of bitumen and bitumen products (road grades, modified bitumens, doped bitumens, emulsions  &amp;  cut-back).'),(9782,838,'header_page_color','#aa6d27'),(9783,838,'header_page_img','203'),(9784,838,'header_page',''),(9785,838,'block_0_fields_text','<strong>Rubis Energie is involved in all stages of the logistics chain: from supply by boat to refineries to distribution on the customer’s site.</strong>\r\n\r\nThe quality of our products and our expertise in this business are recognised by all our customers, public works players involved in the construction of road and motorway infrastructures.\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>An <strong>expert in bitumen sourcing</strong> with over 20 years of experience, the Group’s bitumen division is an expert in bitumen procurement and trading.</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Market leader in West Africa</strong> thanks to our terminals (Cameroon, Gabon, Liberia, Nigeria, Senegal, Togo) and recently established in South Africa, we make products available to our customers 365 days a year that meet their specific needs</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>Integrated logistics</strong>: maritime freight, storage terminal management and road transport are central to our business</li>\r\n 	<li><strong>A quality bitumen for quality roads</strong>: our products are renowned and recognized for their superior and consistent quality.</li>\r\n</ul>'),(9786,838,'block_0_fields',''),(9787,838,'block_1_fields_first_col','<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-140\" src=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/photo18.jpg\" alt=\"Rubis energie - produits - bitumes et produits bitumineux\" width=\"296\" height=\"198\" />'),(9788,838,'block_1_fields_second_col','<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-141\" src=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/photo19-300x169.jpg\" alt=\"Rubis energie - produits - bitumes et produits bitumineux\" width=\"300\" height=\"169\" />'),(9789,838,'block_1_fields_slider_0_image','478'),(9790,838,'block_1_fields_slider_1_image','477'),(9791,838,'block_1_fields_slider_2_image','157'),(9792,838,'block_1_fields_slider','8'),(9793,838,'block_1_fields',''),(9794,838,'block_1_fields_slider_3_image','494'),(9795,838,'block_1_fields_slider_4_image','1145'),(9796,838,'block_1_fields_slider_5_image','496'),(9797,838,'block_2_fields_text','&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;'),(9798,838,'block_2_fields',''),(9799,838,'_thumbnail_id','203'),(9800,838,'_yoast_wpseo_title','Bitumens and bituminous products | Retail by Rubis Energie'),(9801,838,'_yoast_wpseo_metadesc','Today, through its subsidiaries Rubis Asphalt, ERES and ASCA, it is the leader in West Africa in the distribution of bitumen and bitumen products (road grades, modified bitumens, doped bitumens, emulsions  &  cut-back).'),(9802,838,'_yoast_wpseo_focuskw','bitumens'),(9803,838,'_edit_lock','1636992786:2'),(9804,838,'_edit_last','2'),(9805,838,'_header_page_text','field_60dad748a56be'),(9806,838,'_header_page_color','field_60dad74ca56bf'),(9807,838,'_header_page_img','field_60dad753a56c0'),(9808,838,'_header_page','field_60dad72fa56bc'),(9809,838,'_block_0_fields_text','field_5d318356707db'),(9810,838,'_block_0_fields','field_5d31c477d5643'),(9811,838,'_block_1_fields_slider_0_image','field_5d31be18faf3f'),(9812,838,'_block_1_fields_slider_1_image','field_5d31be18faf3f'),(9813,838,'_block_1_fields_slider_2_image','field_5d31be18faf3f'),(9814,838,'_block_1_fields_slider_3_image','field_5d31be18faf3f'),(9815,838,'_block_1_fields_slider_4_image','field_5d31be18faf3f'),(9816,838,'_block_1_fields_slider_5_image','field_5d31be18faf3f'),(9817,838,'_block_1_fields_slider','field_5d31bdd2faf3c'),(9818,838,'_block_1_fields','field_5d31c3ddd563d'),(9819,838,'_block_2_fields_text','field_5d318356707db'),(9820,838,'_block_2_fields','field_5d31c477d5643'),(9821,838,'_block','field_5d31c1ded5632'),(9822,838,'_is_block_prd','field_60d9cc3911a1c'),(9823,838,'_is_block_