"Rubis energie - produits - carburants aériens\" width=\"300\" height=\"222\" />'),(9906,841,'block_0_fields_text','Safety is paramount in all aspects of aviation.'),(9907,841,'block_0_fields',''),(9908,841,'block_1_fields_first_col','<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-135\" src=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/photo13-300x225.jpg\" alt=\"Rubis energie - produits - carburants aériens\" width=\"300\" height=\"225\" />'),(9909,841,'block_1_fields_second_col','<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-136\" src=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/photo14-300x199.jpg\" alt=\"Rubis energie - produits - carburants aériens\" width=\"300\" height=\"199\" />'),(9910,841,'block_1_fields_third_col','<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-137\" src=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/photo15-300x222.jpg\" alt=\"Rubis energie - produits - carburants aériens\" width=\"300\" height=\"222\" />'),(9911,841,'block_1_fields_slider_0_image','393'),(9912,841,'block_1_fields_slider_1_image','528'),(9913,841,'block_1_fields_slider','4'),(9914,841,'block_1_fields',''),(9915,841,'block_1_fields_slider_2_image','198'),(9916,841,'block_1_fields_slider_3_image','427'),(9917,841,'block_2_fields_text','This is why we are proud to provide aviation fuels that meet the most demanding specifications.'),(9918,841,'block_2_fields',''),(9919,841,'_thumbnail_id','196'),(9920,841,'_yoast_wpseo_title','Aviation fuels | Retail by Rubis Energie'),(9921,841,'_yoast_wpseo_metadesc','We supply thousands of aircraft each year and supply millions of litres of jet fuel.'),(9922,841,'_yoast_wpseo_focuskw','aviation fuels'),(9923,841,'_edit_lock','1635870610:2'),(9924,841,'_edit_last','2'),(9925,841,'_header_page_text','field_60dad748a56be'),(9926,841,'_header_page_color','field_60dad74ca56bf'),(9927,841,'_header_page_img','field_60dad753a56c0'),(9928,841,'_header_page','field_60dad72fa56bc'),(9929,841,'_block_0_fields_text','field_5d318356707db'),(9930,841,'_block_0_fields','field_5d31c477d5643'),(9931,841,'_block_1_fields_slider_0_image','field_5d31be18faf3f'),(9932,841,'_block_1_fields_slider_1_image','field_5d31be18faf3f'),(9933,841,'_block_1_fields_slider_2_image','field_5d31be18faf3f'),(9934,841,'_block_1_fields_slider_3_image','field_5d31be18faf3f'),(9935,841,'_block_1_fields_slider','field_5d31bdd2faf3c'),(9936,841,'_block_1_fields','field_5d31c3ddd563d'),(9937,841,'_block_2_fields_text','field_5d318356707db'),(9938,841,'_block_2_fields','field_5d31c477d5643'),(9939,841,'_block','field_5d31c1ded5632'),(9940,841,'_is_block_prd','field_60d9cc3911a1c'),(9941,841,'_is_block_map','field_60d9cc5011a1d'),(9942,841,'_yoast_wpseo_linkdex','40'),(9943,841,'_yoast_wpseo_content_score','60'),(9944,841,'_yoast_wpseo_estimated-reading-time-minutes',''),(9945,842,'is_block_prd','1'),(9946,842,'is_block_map','0'),(9947,842,'block','a:1:{i:0;s:10:\"block.text\";}'),(9948,842,'header_page_text','The Group markets several types of fuel oil and diesel to meet the needs of its customers.'),(9949,842,'header_page_color','#aa6d27'),(9950,842,'header_page_img','391'),(9951,842,'header_page',''),(9952,842,'block_0_fields_text','For example, in our refinery in the French Antillas (SARA) fuels are produced and then retailed.\r\n\r\n<strong>Heavy fuel oil</strong> (fuel oil 380) is used as a fuel in certain industries, but above all, as fuel for slow engines intended to produce electricity. It serves as a marine fuel, i.e. a cargo hold for large propulsion vessels.\r\n\r\n<strong>Light fuel oil</strong> (fuel oil 80) is used as fuel in small industries (laundry, industrial, bakeries, pottery etc.)\r\n\r\n<strong>Domestic fuel oil</strong> is mainly used in turbines to generate electricity. It is also used by agricultural machinery or \"fast\" motorboats.\r\n\r\n<img class=\"size-full wp-image-392 alignleft\" src=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/Sans-titre.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"320\" height=\"212\" />'),(9953,842,'block_0_fields',''),(9954,842,'block_1_fields_first_col','<img class=\"alignnone size-medium wp-image-133\" src=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/photo11-300x201.jpg\" alt=\"rubis energie - produits - combustibles pour l\'industrie\" width=\"300\" height=\"201\" />'),(9955,842,'block_1_fields_second_col','<img class=\"alignnone  wp-image-134\" src=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/photo12.jpg\" alt=\"rubis energie - produits - combustibles pour l\'industrie\" width=\"290\" height=\"193\" />'),(9956,842,'_thumbnail_id','391'),(9957,842,'_yoast_wpseo_title','Fuels for industries | Retail by Rubis Energie'),(9958,842,'_yoast_wpseo_metadesc','The Group markets several types of fuel oil and diesel to meet the needs of its customers.'),(9959,842,'_yoast_wpseo_focuskw','fuels for industries'),(9960,842,'_edit_lock','1635522319:2'),(9961,842,'_edit_last','2'),(9962,842,'_header_page_text','field_60dad748a56be'),(9963,842,'_header_page_color','field_60dad74ca56bf'),(9964,842,'_header_page_img','field_60dad753a56c0'),(9965,842,'_header_page','field_60dad72fa56bc'),(9966,842,'_block_0_fields_text','field_5d318356707db'),(9967,842,'_block_0_fields','field_5d31c477d5643'),(9968,842,'_block','field_5d31c1ded5632'),(9969,842,'_is_block_prd','field_60d9cc3911a1c'),(9970,842,'_is_block_map','field_60d9cc5011a1d'),(9971,842,'_yoast_wpseo_linkdex','40'),(9972,842,'_yoast_wpseo_content_score','60'),(9973,842,'_yoast_wpseo_estimated-reading-time-minutes',''),(9974,843,'is_block_prd','1'),(9975,843,'is_block_map','0'),(9976,843,'block','a:3:{i:0;s:10:\"block.text\";i:1;s:17:\"block.two.columns\";i:2;s:10:\"block.text\";}'),(9977,843,'header_page_text',''),(9978,843,'header_page_color','#aa6d27'),(9979,843,'header_page_img','193'),(9980,843,'header_page',''),(9981,843,'block_0_fields_text','<h2>Liquefied gases are packaged in cylinders or stored in overhead or underground tanks</h2>'),(9982,843,'block_1_fields_first_col','<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-194\" src=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/gnl-rubis-energie.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"580\" height=\"400\" />'),(9983,843,'block_1_fields_second_col','Liquefied Gases (Butane &amp; Propane) allow private individuals and certain professionals in the tertiary sector (hotels, health, etc.) to ensure the 3 uses which are heating, hot water and cooking and for professionals (communities, agriculture and industry) heating and processing.\r\n\r\nIn emerging countries, this energy is actively recommended by the public authorities and the WHO as a cooking method, replacing charcoal or paraffin, for health reasons and to combat deforestation.\r\n\r\n<strong>Liquefied Gases, the environmentally friendly transition energy par excellence.</strong>'),(9984,843,'block_1_fields',''),(9985,843,'block_2_fields_first_col','<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-195\" src=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/gnl-rubis-energie-monde.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"580\" height=\"400\" />'),(9986,843,'block_2_fields_second_col','<h3>GNL : Le gaz naturel liquéfié est du gaz naturel qui a été traité pour être transporté sous forme liquide.</h3>\r\nIl s\'agit de la meilleure solution pour fournir une source d\'énergie propre, économique et à faible impact environnemental dans les régions éloignées où il n\'est pas possible de transporter le gaz directement par gazoduc.\r\n\r\nLe GNL vient de la nécessité de faire correspondre l\'offre et la demande de gaz naturel distribué par gazoduc, réduisant ainsi l\'effet de la saisonnalité de sa consommation.\r\n\r\nIl s\'agit du même gaz qui arrive par le réseau de gaz naturel canalisé mais à l\'état liquide.'),(9987,843,'block_3_fields_text','GNL : Le gaz naturel liquéfié est du gaz naturel qui a été traité pour être transporté sous forme liquide. Il s\'agit de la meilleure solution pour fournir une source d\'énergie propre, économique et à faible impact environnemental dans les régions éloignées où il n\'est pas possible de transporter le gaz directement par gazoduc.\r\n\r\nLe GNL vient de la nécessité de faire correspondre l\'offre et la demande de gaz naturel distribué par gazoduc, réduisant ainsi l\'effet de la saisonnalité de sa consommation.\r\n\r\nIl s\'agit du même gaz qui arrive par le réseau de gaz naturel canalisé mais à l\'état liquide.\r\n\r\n<img class=\"size-medium wp-image-132 aligncenter\" src=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/photo10-300x226.jpg\" alt=\"Rubie energie - produits - GPL -GNL\" width=\"300\" height=\"226\" />'),(9988,843,'block_0_fields_first_col','<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-194\" src=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/gnl-rubis-energie.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"580\" height=\"400\" />'),(9989,843,'block_0_fields_second_col','<h3>GPL : Conditionnés en bouteilles, stockés dans des réservoirs aériens ou enterrés</h3>\r\nLes GPLs permettent aux particuliers d’assurer les 3 usages que sont le chauffage, l’eau chaude et la cuisson et aux professionnels (collectivités et industries) le chauffage et le process. Dans les pays émergents, cette énergie est activement recommandée par les pouvoirs publics et l’OMS comme mode de cuisson, en substitution du charbon de bois ou du pétrole lampant, pour des raisons sanitaires et afin de lutter contre la déforestation.\r\n\r\n<strong>Le GPL, l’énergie de transition par excellence.</strong>'),(9990,843,'block_0_fields',''),(9991,843,'block_2_fields_text',''),(9992,843,'block_2_fields',''),(9993,843,'block_3_fields_first_col','<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-195\" src=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/gnl-rubis-energie-monde.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"580\" height=\"400\" />'),(9994,843,'block_3_fields_second_col','Il s\'agit de la meilleure solution pour fournir une source d\'énergie propre, économique et à faible impact environnemental dans les régions éloignées où il n\'est pas possible de transporter le gaz directement par gazoduc.\r\n\r\nLe GNL vient de la nécessité de faire correspondre l\'offre et la demande de gaz naturel distribué par gazoduc, réduisant ainsi l\'effet de la saisonnalité de sa consommation.\r\n\r\nIl s\'agit du même gaz qui arrive par le réseau de gaz naturel canalisé mais à l\'état liquide.'),(9996,843,'_thumbnail_id','193'),(9997,843,'_yoast_wpseo_title','Liquefied gaz | Retail by Rubis Energie'),(9998,843,'_yoast_wpseo_metadesc','Liquefied Gases, the environmentally friendly transition energy par excellence.'),(9999,843,'_yoast_wpseo_focuskw','gpl'),(10000,843,'_edit_lock','1637679130:2'),(10001,843,'_edit_last','2'),(10002,843,'_header_page_text','field_60dad748a56be'),(10003,843,'_header_page_color','field_60dad74ca56bf'),(10004,843,'_header_page_img','field_60dad753a56c0'),(10005,843,'_header_page','field_60dad72fa56bc'),(10006,843,'_block_0_fields_text','field_5d318356707db'),(10007,843,'_block_0_fields','field_5d31c477d5643'),(10008,843,'_block_1_fields_first_col','field_5d318c36a146c'),(10009,843,'_block_1_fields_second_col','field_5d318c47a146d'),(10010,843,'_block_1_fields','field_5d31c609d5649'),(10011,843,'_block_2_fields_text','field_5d318356707db'),(10012,843,'_block_2_fields','field_5d31c477d5643'),(10013,843,'_block_3_fields_first_col','field_5d318c36a146c'),(10014,843,'_block_3_fields_second_col','field_5d318c47a146d'),(10016,843,'_block','field_5d31c1ded5632'),(10017,843,'_is_block_prd','field_60d9cc3911a1c'),(10018,843,'_is_block_map','field_60d9cc5011a1d'),(10019,843,'_yoast_wpseo_linkdex','33'),(10020,843,'_yoast_wpseo_content_score','60'),(10021,843,'_yoast_wpseo_estimated-reading-time-minutes',''),(10022,844,'is_block_prd','1'),(10023,844,'is_block_map','0'),(10024,844,'block','a:6:{i:0;s:10:\"block.text\";i:1;s:12:\"block.slider\";i:2;s:10:\"block.text\";i:3;s:17:\"block.two.columns\";i:4;s:10:\"block.text\";i:5;s:10:\"block.text\";}'),(10025,844,'header_page_text','Every day in 23 countries through our 1,026 service stations, we sell premium road fuels to thousands of road users.'),(10026,844,'header_page_color','#aa6d27'),(10027,844,'header_page_img','104'),(10028,844,'header_page',''),(10029,844,'block_0_fields_text','<h2>Regular or premium (petrol/diesel) fuels:</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Ultra Tec unleaded (*)</li>\r\n 	<li>Diesels with very low sulphur content (ULSD) Ultra Tec additives (*)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<em>(*) Ultra Tec is an advanced fuel additive found in our RUBIS and VITO fuels. It is the vanguard of additive technology. It improves vehicle cleanliness and performance while reducing fuel consumption and emissions for a cleaner environment.</em>\r\n\r\n<img class=\"size-full wp-image-385 alignleft\" src=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/loho-1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" /><img class=\"size-full wp-image-386 alignleft\" src=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/logo-2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"95\" height=\"95\" />'),(10030,844,'block_0_fields',''),(10031,844,'block_1_fields_first_col','<img class=\"alignnone wp-image-187 size-full\" src=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/rubis-energie-carburants-stations-service.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"350\" height=\"200\" />'),(10032,844,'block_1_fields_second_col','<img class=\"alignnone wp-image-189 size-full\" src=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/rubis-energie-carburants-stations-service-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"350\" height=\"200\" />'),(10033,844,'block_1_fields_third_col','<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-190\" src=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/rubis-energie-carburants-stations-service-2.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"350\" height=\"200\" />'),(10034,844,'block_2_fields_text','<h6 style=\"text-align: center;\">The logos <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-387\" src=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/logo-rubis-1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"60\" height=\"47\" /> and <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-388\" src=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/logo-vito.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"60\" height=\"47\" /> adorn the totems of our stations around the world</h6>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<h2></h2>\r\n<h2>Alternative fuels:</h2>\r\n<h3>LPG fuel</h3>'),(10035,844,'block_3_fields_first_col','<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-191\" src=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/gpl-carburant-france-rubis-energie.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"580\" height=\"400\" />\r\n\r\n<em>In France, our LPG fuel is distributed at 291 stations in the BP network and the supermarket network under the GAZ’L brand.</em>\r\n\r\n<em> </em>'),(10036,844,'block_3_fields_second_col','<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-192\" src=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/gpl-carburant-espagne-rubis-energie.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"580\" height=\"400\" />\r\n\r\n<em>In Spain, our LPG fuel is distributed at 233 stations in the DISA network and other independent companies under the Autogas brand.</em>\r\n\r\n&nbsp;'),(10037,844,'block_4_fields_text','Due to its limited ecological footprint, LPG fuel is supported by many measures put in place by governments.\r\n\r\nCompared to petrol or diesel, the environmental impact of LPG fuel is much more favourable. In real traffic conditions, a LPG fuel vehicle emits 18% less CO2 on average, 10 times fewer fine particles and up to 97% less CO than a petrol vehicle. LPG fuel nitrogen oxide (NOx) emissions are equivalent to gasoline, but 13 times lower than diesel.'),(10038,844,'block_5_fields_text','<h3>Biofuels</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Synthetic biodiesel</strong>, HVO (hydrotreated vegetable oil)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nIn the Channel Islands, we market advanced biofuel, produced from plant, residual or waste raw materials and marketed under the name RD100.\r\n\r\nCurrently, it is the most sustainable fuel for diesel vehicles on the market, with 89% less CO2 emissions, 30% less particles and 9% less nitrogen oxides compared with fossil diesel.\r\n\r\nStarting to offer HVO at our service stations is a way for us to contribute to the transition to sustainable mobility and meet our customers’ demand for non-fossil fuels. With HVO, the main pollution problems are already solved. This will give the diesel engine a new future.\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone wp-image-389\" src=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/RD100.png\" alt=\"Biodiesel RD100 logo\" width=\"230\" height=\"85\" />\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>SP95 - E10\r\n</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\nWe distribute SP95-E10 fuel in our Corsican and Jamaican stations. It is an unleaded petrol that contains up to 10% ethanol in volume.\r\n\r\nBioethanol is currently the only renewable energy immediately available partially replace petrol. It is produced from plants, mixed with petrol, then distributed to service stations.\r\n\r\nBioethanol reduces net greenhouse gas emissions by more than 71% (source: ePURE 2018) on average compared with petrol.\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-420\" src=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/rubis-energie-sp95-e10.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"250\" height=\"130\" />\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n&nbsp;'),(10039,844,'block_5_fields',''),(10040,844,'block_2_fields_first_col','<img class=\"alignnone wp-image-187 size-full\" src=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/rubis-energie-carburants-stations-service.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"350\" height=\"200\" />'),(10041,844,'block_2_fields_second_col','<img class=\"alignnone wp-image-189 size-full\" src=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/rubis-energie-carburants-stations-service-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"350\" height=\"200\" />'),(10042,844,'block_2_fields_third_col','<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-190\" src=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/rubis-energie-carburants-stations-service-2.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"350\" height=\"200\" />'),(10043,844,'block_3_fields_text','<h2>Carburants alternatifs :</h2>\r\n<h3>GPL carburant</h3>'),(10044,844,'block_4_fields_first_col','<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-191\" src=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/gpl-carburant-france-rubis-energie.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"580\" height=\"400\" />\r\n\r\n<em>En France, notre GPL carburant est distribué dans 291 stations du réseau BP et de la Grande et Moyenne Distribution sous la marque GAZ’L.</em>'),(10045,844,'block_4_fields_second_col','<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-192\" src=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/gpl-carburant-espagne-rubis-energie.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"580\" height=\"400\" />\r\n\r\n<em>En Espagne, notre GPL carburant est distribué dans 233 stations du réseau DISA et autres indépendants sous la marque Autogas.</em>'),(10046,844,'block_6_fields_text','<h3>Biocarburant</h3>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Le biodiesel de</strong> <strong>synthèse</strong>, le HVO (hydrotreated Vegetable Oil)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nDans les Iles Anglo-Normandes, nous commercialisons un biocarburant avancé, produit à partir de matières premières végétales, résiduelles ou de déchets et commercialisé sous le nom de RD100.\r\n\r\nActuellement, c\'est le carburant le plus durable pour véhicules diesel sur le marché, avec moins 89% d\'émissions de CO2, moins 30% de particules et moins 9% d\'oxydes d\'azote par rapport au diesel fossile.\r\n\r\nCommencer à proposer du HVO dans nos stations-service est pour nous un moyen de contribuer à la transition vers une mobilité durable et de répondre à la demande de nos clients en carburants non-fossiles. Avec le HVO, les principaux problèmes de pollution sont déjà résolus. Cela donnera un nouvel avenir au moteur diesel.\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone wp-image-389\" src=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/RD100.png\" alt=\"Biodiesel RD100 logo\" width=\"230\" height=\"85\" />\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li><strong>Le SP95 - E10\r\n</strong></li>\r\n</ul>\r\nDans nos stations corses et jamaïcaines, nous distribuons du carburant SP95-E10. C\'est une essence sans plomb qui contient jusqu\'à 10% d\'éthanol en volume.\r\n\r\nLe bioéthanol est à ce jour la seule énergie renouvelable immédiatement disponible pour remplacer une partie de l’essence. Il est produit à partir de végétaux, mélangé à l’essence, puis distribué dans les stations-service.\r\n\r\nLe bioéthanol permet de diminuer les émissions nettes de gaz à effet de serre de plus de 71 % (source : ePURE 2018) en moyenne par rapport à l’essence.\r\n\r\n<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-420\" src=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/rubis-energie-sp95-e10.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"250\" height=\"130\" />'),(10047,844,'block_1_fields_text','<h2>Carburants (essence / diesel) ordinaires ou premium :</h2>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Des essences additivées à l\'Ultra Tec (*)</li>\r\n 	<li>Des diesels, à très faible teneur en soufre (ULSD), additivés à l’Ultra Tec (*)</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<em>(*) Ultra Tec est un additif de carburant avancé présent dans nos carburants RUBIS et VITO. Il représente l\'avant-garde de la technologie des additifs. Il permet d\'améliorer la propreté et les performances des véhicules tout en réduisant la consommation de carburant et les émissions pour un environnement plus propre.</em>\r\n\r\n<img class=\"size-full wp-image-385 alignleft\" src=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/loho-1.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" /><img class=\"size-full wp-image-386 alignleft\" src=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/logo-2.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"95\" height=\"95\" />'),(10048,844,'block_2_fields_slider_0_image','418'),(10049,844,'block_2_fields_slider_1_image','416'),(10050,844,'block_2_fields_slider_2_image','415'),(10051,844,'block_2_fields_slider','5'),(10052,844,'block_2_fields_slider_3_image','417'),(10053,844,'block_2_fields_slider_4_image','285'),(10054,844,'block_1_fields_slider_0_image','418'),(10055,844,'block_1_fields_slider_1_image','416'),(10056,844,'block_1_fields_slider_2_image','415'),(10057,844,'block_1_fields_slider_3_image','417'),(10058,844,'block_1_fields_slider_4_image','285'),(10059,844,'block_1_fields_slider','5'),(10060,844,'block_1_fields',''),(10061,844,'block_2_fields',''),(10062,844,'block_3_fields',''),(10063,844,'block_4_fields',''),(10064,844,'_thumbnail_id','104'),(10065,844,'_yoast_wpseo_title','Fuels in service stations | Retail by Rubis Energie'),(10066,844,'_yoast_wpseo_metadesc','Every day in 23 countries through our 1,051 service stations, we sell premium road fuels to thousands of road users.'),(10067,844,'_yoast_wpseo_focuskw','Fuels in service stations'),(10068,844,'_edit_lock','1653398943:2'),(10069,844,'_edit_last','2'),(10070,844,'_header_page_text','field_60dad748a56be'),(10071,844,'_header_page_color','field_60dad74ca56bf'),(10072,844,'_header_page_img','field_60dad753a56c0'),(10073,844,'_header_page','field_60dad72fa56bc'),(10074,844,'_block_0_fields_text','field_5d318356707db'),(10075,844,'_block_0_fields','field_5d31c477d5643'),(10076,844,'_block_1_fields_slider_0_image','field_5d31be18faf3f'),(10077,844,'_block_1_fields_slider_1_image','field_5d31be18faf3f'),(10078,844,'_block_1_fields_slider_2_image','field_5d31be18faf3f'),(10079,844,'_block_1_fields_slider_3_image','field_5d31be18faf3f'),(10080,844,'_block_1_fields_slider_4_image','field_5d31be18faf3f'),(10081,844,'_block_1_fields_slider','field_5d31bdd2faf3c'),(10082,844,'_block_1_fields','field_5d31c3ddd563d'),(10083,844,'_block_2_fields_text','field_5d318356707db'),(10084,844,'_block_2_fields','field_5d31c477d5643'),(10085,844,'_block_3_fields_first_col','field_5d318c36a146c'),(10086,844,'_block_3_fields_second_col','field_5d318c47a146d'),(10087,844,'_block_3_fields','field_5d31c609d5649'),(10088,844,'_block_4_fields_text','field_5d318356707db'),(10089,844,'_block_4_fields','field_5d31c477d5643'),(10090,844,'_block_5_fields_text','field_5d318356707db'),(10091,844,'_block_5_fields','field_5d31c477d5643'),(10092,844,'_block','field_5d31c1ded5632'),(10093,844,'_is_block_prd','field_60d9cc3911a1c'),(10094,844,'_is_block_map','field_60d9cc5011a1d'),(10095,844,'_yoast_wpseo_linkdex','47'),(10096,844,'_yoast_wpseo_content_score','60'),(10097,844,'_yoast_wpseo_estimated-reading-time-minutes',''),(10098,845,'_edit_lock','1687267721:2'),(10099,845,'_edit_last','1'),(10100,845,'_wp_page_template','default'),(10101,845,'header_page_text',''),(10