block.text\";i:8;s:12:\"block.slider\";i:9;s:10:\"block.text\";i:10;s:11:\"block.actus\";i:11;s:10:\"block.text\";i:12;s:17:\"block.two.columns\";}'),(12058,932,'header_page_text',''),(12059,932,'header_page_color','#01614d'),(12060,932,'header_page_img','296'),(12061,932,'header_page',''),(12062,932,'block_0_fields_text','<h2> <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1063\" src=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/ODD8-EN-300x300.png\" alt=\"Logo ODD 8\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" /> <img class=\"alignnone wp-image-1065\" src=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/ODD16-EN-300x300.png\" alt=\"Logo ODD 16\" width=\"120\" height=\"120\" /></h2>\r\n<h2></h2>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<h2>Act with professionalism and integrity<em>\r\n</em></h2>\r\nRubis Energie is based on the main principles of the Rubis Group\'s Code of Ethics\r\n\r\n<a class=\"cta green\" href=\"https://www.rubis.fr/en/ethique-compliance/le-code-ethique\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Consult the Group\'s Code of Ethics</a>\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Compliance with applicable laws and regulations</li>\r\n 	<li>Promoting safety and respect for the environment</li>\r\n 	<li>Respect for people</li>\r\n 	<li>Rejection of corruption in all its forms:</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<a class=\"cta green\" title=\"Guide anti-corruption du Groupe\" href=\"https://www.rubis.fr/en/ethique-compliance/le-programme-anti-corruption\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Consult the Group\'s anti-corruption guide</a>\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Prevention of conflicts of interest and insider trading</li>\r\n 	<li>Compliance with competition rules</li>\r\n</ul>\r\nA single alert system within the Group: the <strong>Rubis</strong><em><strong> Integrity Line</strong></em>.\r\n\r\nSet up in 2018, it allows all employees and external employees to file an alert securely and confidentially on any situation that is contrary to Rubis’ Code of Ethics (corruption, environment, security, fraud, personal data, human rights etc.).\r\n\r\n&nbsp;\r\n\r\n<img class=\"wp-image-759 aligncenter\" src=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/Integrity-Line.png\" alt=\"Logo Rubis Ligne d\'alerte\" width=\"250\" height=\"87\" />'),(12063,932,'block_0_fields',''),(12064,932,'block_1_fields_first_col','<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-465\" src=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/rubis-energie-agir-ethique-2.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"580\" height=\"340\" />'),(12065,932,'block_1_fields_second_col','<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-464\" src=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/rubis-energie-agir-ethique-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"580\" height=\"340\" />'),(12066,932,'block_1_fields_third_col','<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-208 aligncenter\" src=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/rubis-energie-engagements-employabilite.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"960\" height=\"640\" />\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>S’engager pour</strong>\r\n<strong>l’employabilité</strong></p>'),(12067,932,'block_1_fields_text','<h2></h2>\r\n<h2>Assurer une gestion responsable de notre chaine d’approvisionnement<em>\r\n</em></h2>\r\nLe Groupe Rubis étant signataire du Pacte mondial des Nations Unies, nous sommes engagés à promouvoir les dix principes fondamentaux du Pacte visant les droits de la personne, le travail, l’environnement et la lutte contre la corruption.\r\n\r\nNotre Code Ethique est repris dans nos conditions générales d’achat et de vente afin de nous assurer que l’ensemble de nos fournisseurs et de nos clients respectent nos valeurs.\r\n\r\nNous travaillons actuellement :\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>A intégrer systématiquement des critères RSE dans la sélection des fournisseurs et prestataires pour les CAPEX les plus significatifs de l’entreprise.</li>\r\n 	<li>A développer l’économie circulaire au travers d’actions innovantes.</li>\r\n</ul>'),(12068,932,'block_2_fields_first_col','<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-465\" src=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/rubis-energie-agir-ethique-2.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"580\" height=\"340\" />'),(12069,932,'block_2_fields_second_col','<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-464\" src=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/rubis-energie-agir-ethique-1.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"580\" height=\"340\" />'),(12070,932,'block_2_fields_third_col','<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-208 aligncenter\" src=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/rubis-energie-engagements-employabilite.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"960\" height=\"640\" />\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>S’engager pour</strong>\r\n<strong>l’employabilité</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><a href=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/engagements/employabilite/\">en savoir plus</a></span></p>'),(12071,932,'block_2_fields_text','&nbsp;\r\n<h2>Responsible management of our supply chain</h2>\r\nAs the Rubis Group is a signatory to the United Nations Global Compact, we are committed to promoting the ten fundamental principles of the pact aimed at human rights, labour, the environment, and the fight against corruption.\r\n\r\nOur Code of Ethics is included in our general terms and conditions of purchase and sale to ensure that all our suppliers and customers respect our values.\r\n\r\nWe are currently working:\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Systematically include CSR criteria in the selection of suppliers and service providers for the company\'s most significant CAPEX.</li>\r\n 	<li>To develop the circular economy through innovative actions.</li>\r\n</ul>'),(12072,932,'block_3_fields_text','&nbsp;\r\n<h2>Rubis Group\'s corporate philanthropy: a strong anchoring of subsidiaries within local communities</h2>\r\nOur subsidiaries are committed to the countries in which they operate, both economically and socially, as well as culturally and in terms of living together.'),(12073,932,'block_4_fields_first_col','<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-300\" src=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/rubis-energie-gaiana.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"580\" height=\"340\" />'),(12074,932,'block_4_fields_second_col',''),(12075,932,'block_4_fields_third_col','<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-208 aligncenter\" src=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/rubis-energie-engagements-employabilite.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"960\" height=\"640\" />\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>S’engager pour</strong>\r\n<strong>l’employabilité</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><a href=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/engagements/employabilite/\">en savoir plus</a></span></p>'),(12076,932,'block_3_fields_first_col','<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-300\" src=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/rubis-energie-gaiana.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"580\" height=\"340\" />'),(12077,932,'block_3_fields_second_col','<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-414\" src=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/rubis-energie-lutte-covid-19.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"580\" height=\"340\" />'),(12078,932,'block_4_fields_text','<h3>A commitment by our subsidiaries to improve access to education, training and health for vulnerable populations.</h3>\r\nIn line with the Group\'s desire to be fully integrated into the regions in which it operates and to contribute to their development, our subsidiaries support community projects working in the fields of education and health. Each association project is supported by the local subsidiary and is adapted to the problems in the field in order to best meet the expectations of the populations.\r\n\r\n<em>Key figures in 2021:</em>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>Over 30 local associations and projects supported;</li>\r\n 	<li>In nearly 25 territories where the Group operates;</li>\r\n 	<li>More than 400 employees involved with the associations supported by the subsidiaries: sponsorship activities, fundraising, meetings, etc.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<em>The social actions carried out can be broken down as follows:</em>\r\n<ul>\r\n 	<li>In Africa, 62% for education, 38% for health;</li>\r\n 	<li>In the Caribbean, 84% for education, 16% for health;</li>\r\n 	<li>In Europe, 43% for education, 57% for health.</li>\r\n</ul>'),(12079,932,'block_5_fields_slider','10'),(12080,932,'block_6_fields_text','<h3></h3>\r\n<h3>A commitment by our subsidiaries to provide access to art and promote local cultures with the Rubis Mécénat endowment fund.</h3>\r\nCreated in 2011 with the aim of being a cultural and social player that extends beyond the economic role of the Rubis Group in its territories, Rubis Mécénat develops committed artistic projects adapted to the local problems of each territory while favouring a long-term commitment and support.\r\n\r\nWith Rubis Energie\'s subsidiaries, Rubis Mécénat has developed 3 educational programmes in South Africa, Jamaica and Madagascar and trained more than 150 young adults in various artistic fields while awarding more than 60 scholarships in these countries.\r\n\r\nThe fund also commissions works from French and international artists, in collaboration with cultural institutions and the Group\'s subsidiaries, with the same desire to create professional and supportive projects. Finally, in-house art projects are carried out in the offices of the subsidiaries, and the art collection of the fund is exhibited there.\r\n\r\n<a class=\"cta green\" href=\"http://www.rubismecenat.fr/en/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">For more information: www.rubismecenat.fr</a>'),(12081,932,'block_7_fields_text','<h3></h3>\r\n<h3>A commitment by our subsidiaries to natural disasters and humanitarian crises</h3>\r\nImplementation of exceptional donations to meet the urgent needs of populations affected by natural disasters or humanitarian crises in the territories where the Group operates.'),(12082,932,'block_8_fields_first_col','<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-207 aligncenter\" src=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/rubis-energie-engagements-lutte-changement-climatique.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"960\" height=\"640\" />\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Lutter contre le</strong>\r\n<strong>changement climatique</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><a class=\"cta green\" href=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/engagements/lutter-changement-climatique/\">en savoir plus</a></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p>'),(12083,932,'block_8_fields_second_col','<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-218 aligncenter\" src=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/rubis-energie-garantie-securite.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"960\" height=\"640\" />\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Garantir la sécurité et</strong>\r\n<strong>Préserver l’environnement</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><a class=\"cta green\" href=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/engagements/garantir-securite-preserver-environnement/\">en savoir plus</a></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p>'),(12084,932,'block_8_fields_third_col','<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-208 aligncenter\" src=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/rubis-energie-engagements-employabilite.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"960\" height=\"640\" />\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>S’engager pour</strong>\r\n<strong>l’employabilité</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><a class=\"cta green\" href=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/engagements/employabilite/\">en savoir plus</a></span></p>'),(12085,932,'block_5_fields_slider_0_image','301'),(12086,932,'block_5_fields_slider_1_image','467'),(12087,932,'block_5_fields_slider_2_image','465'),(12088,932,'block_5_fields_slider_3_image','303'),(12089,932,'block_4_fields_slider_0_image','485'),(12090,932,'block_4_fields_slider_1_image','486'),(12091,932,'block_4_fields_slider_2_image','487'),(12092,932,'block_4_fields_slider_3_image','488'),(12093,932,'block_4_fields_slider','4'),(12094,932,'block_5_fields_text','<h3>Commitment of our subsidiaries to health and education</h3>\r\nIn each country where we operate, the subsidiaries of Rubis Energie care about each of the communities in which they operate.\r\n\r\nRubis Energie and its subsidiaries support the populations and youth of these nations through the support of local associations, scholarships and funds allocated to hospitals.'),(12095,932,'block_7_fields_first_col','<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-207 aligncenter\" src=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/rubis-energie-engagements-lutte-changement-climatique.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"960\" height=\"640\" />\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Lutter contre le</strong>\r\n<strong>changement climatique</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><a class=\"cta green\" href=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/engagements/lutter-changement-climatique/\">en savoir plus</a></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p>'),(12096,932,'block_7_fields_second_col','<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-218 aligncenter\" src=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/rubis-energie-garantie-securite.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"960\" height=\"640\" />\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Garantir la sécurité et</strong>\r\n<strong>Préserver l’environnement</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><a class=\"cta green\" href=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/engagements/garantir-securite-preserver-environnement/\">en savoir plus</a></span></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p>'),(12097,932,'block_7_fields_third_col','<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-208 aligncenter\" src=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/rubis-energie-engagements-employabilite.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"960\" height=\"640\" />\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>S’engager pour</strong>\r\n<strong>l’employabilité</strong></p>\r\n<p sty