gements-lutte-changement-climatique.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"960\" height=\"640\" />\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Reduce the environmental footprint of our activities\r\n</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a class=\"cta green\" href=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/en/our-engagements/reduce-environmental-footprint-our-activities/\">read more</a></p>'),(12133,932,'block_10_fields_second_col','<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-208 aligncenter\" src=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/rubis-energie-engagements-employabilite.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"960\" height=\"640\" />\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Provide a safe and stimulating environment for our employees\r\n</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a class=\"cta green\" href=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/en/our-engagements/provide-safe-and-stimulating-environment/\">read more</a></p>'),(12134,932,'block_10_fields_third_col','<img class=\"alignnone size-full wp-image-208 aligncenter\" src=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/rubis-energie-engagements-employabilite.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"960\" height=\"640\" />\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>S’engager pour</strong>\r\n<strong>l’employabilité</strong></p>\r\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-decoration: underline;\"><a class=\"cta green\" href=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/engagements/employabilite/\">en savoir plus</a></span></p>'),(12135,932,'block_1_fields_slider_0_image','855'),(12136,932,'block_1_fields_slider','1'),(12137,932,'block_1_fields',''),(12138,932,'block_3_fields',''),(12142,932,'block_7_fields',''),(12144,932,'block_9_fields',''),(12146,932,'_wp_page_template','default'),(12147,932,'_thumbnail_id','296'),(12148,932,'_yoast_wpseo_title','Contribuate to a more virtuos society | Rubis Energie Commitments'),(12149,932,'_yoast_wpseo_metadesc','Rubis Energie acts ethically and socially by caring for each of the communities in which they operate.'),(12150,932,'_yo