onales de la concurrence et de toute autre autorité compétente.\r\n\r\n<a href=\"https://rubiskenya.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">KenolKobil</a> correspond parfaitement aux objectifs et critères d\'investissement du Groupe Rubis et viendra idéalement compléter la position de RUBIS ENERGIE en Afrique, dans un secteur particulièrement prometteur où le Groupe entend apporter une nouvelle impulsion.\r\n<p class=\"rteright\"><a href=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/noi-final-artwork-24102018.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Annonce publique : OPA</a></p>\r\n<p class=\"rteright\"><a class=\"target-blank\" href=\"https://rubis.fr/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Groupe Rubis</a></p>'),(13744,1002,'_block_1_fields_text','field_5d318356707db'),(13745,1002,'_yoast_wpseo_primary_category','136'),(13747,1002,'post_imgs',''),(13748,1002,'_post_imgs','field_614dc88d40bbc'),(13749,1002,'_thumbnail_id','785'),(13750,1002,'_dp_original','546'),(13751,1002,'_edit_lock','1635785299:2'),(13752,1002,'_edit_last','2'),(13754,1002,'_wp_old_date','2021-11-01'),(13755,1002,'_yoast_wpseo_focuskw','Gabon'),(13756,1002,'_yoast_wpseo_linkdex','51'),(13758,1002,'_wp_old_slug','gabon-further-development-of-our-bitumen-business-in-africa'),(13759,1003,'is_block_prd','0'),(13760,1003,'_is_block_prd','field_60d9cc3911a1c'),(13761,1003,'is_block_map','0'),(13762,1003,'_is_block_map','field_60d9cc5011a1d'),(13763,1003,'block','a:1:{i:0;s:10:\"block.text\";}'),(13764,1003,'_block','field_5d31c1ded5632'),(13765,1003,'header_page_text','We now supply the RD100, in a STANDARD manner, to all our service stations in Guernsey.'),(13766,1003,'_header_page_text','field_60dad748a56be'),(13767,1003,'header_page_color','#4a58c1'),(13768,1003,'_header_page_color','field_60dad74ca56bf'),(13769,1003,'header_page_img','603'),(13770,1003,'_header_page_img','field_60dad753a56c0'),(13771,1003,'header_page',''),(13772,1003,'_header_page','field_60dad72fa56bc'),(13773,1003,'_yoast_wpseo_content_score','90'),(13774,1003,'_yoast_wpseo_estimated-reading-time-minutes','1'),(13775,1003,'_wp_old_date','2021-07-06'),(13776,1003,'_wp_old_date','2021-09-15'),(13777,1003,'_wp_old_date','2021-09-17'),(13778,1003,'block_0_fields_text','March 2021\r\n\r\nGuernsey is at the forefront of a movement towards a greener future. To support this movement, we now supply the RD100 at all our service stations in Guernsey.\r\n\r\nCommitted to making progress on the island’s journey towards carbon neutrality, this test is a major step by Rubis Energie in understanding the local market’s appetite for renewable fuel. If the trial is successful, we will continue to provide <strong>RD100</strong> across the Guernsey service station network.\r\n\r\nThis is an important moment in the energy transition, where a fossil fuel has been completely replaced by a renewable diesel. And Guernsey is the first jurisdiction in the world to have such access and coverage of renewable fuel.\r\n\r\nOn average, islanders use about 800 litres of diesel per year in their cars. This means that over a year, an islander who opted for the RD100 could save more than two tons of carbon emissions, which is roughly the weight of a large family car.\r\n\r\nReplacing one litre of diesel with renewable diesel reduces carbon emissions by 2.84 kg during the “well-to-wheel” life cycle.\r\n\r\nThis initiative will reduce the environmental impact of transport at the local level, not only in terms of carbon emissions but also in terms of air quality, and since the RD100 is a more sustainable use of resources, it also contributes to reducing environmental impacts beyond our coasts.\r\n\r\nThe RD100 is an easy and modest first step that can make a big difference.  A simple switch to RD100 will help drivers on the island reduce the environmental impact of each trip.\r\n\r\nFill up at a Rubis gas station today and start your journey towards a cleaner, greener future.'),(13779,1003,'_block_0_fields_text','field_5d318356707db'),(13780,1003,'block_0_fields',''),(13781,1003,'_block_0_fields','field_5d31c477d5643'),(13782,1003,'_wp_old_slug','rubis-energie-en-afrique-de-lest-3'),(13783,1003,'_wp_old_slug','gabon-nouveau-developpement-de-notre-activite-bitume-en-afrique'),(13784,1003,'_wp_old_slug','rubis-energie-channel-islands-fuel-ecoheat-100'),(13785,1003,'_yoast_wpseo_title','CHANNEL ISLANDS: A diesel for a greener future, the RD100'),(13786,1003,'_yoast_wpseo_metadesc','We now supply the RD100, in a STANDARD manner, to all our service stations in Guernsey.'),(13787,1003,'block_1_fields_text','<strong>Après l\'acquisition de 24,99 % du capital de KenolKobil Plc, le Groupe Rubis annonce ce jour son intention de lancer une offre publique d\'achat sur le capital restant, conformément au règlement applicable à la Bourse de Nairobi, au Kenyan Capital Markets Act ainsi que toutes autres lois et règlements applicables.</strong>\r\n\r\nKenolKobil, leader de la distribution de produits pétroliers au Kenya, est également implanté au Burundi, Éthiopie, Ouganda, Rwanda et Zambie avec un volume global en distribution finale de 1,3million de m3 en 2017.\r\n\r\nKenolKobil regroupe l\'ensemble des activités de distribution de produits pétroliers : réseaux (350 stations-service), carburants aviation, GPL, lubrifiants, bitume, commercial et industriel, avec des accès sécurisés aux oléoducs et son maillage de 10 terminaux.\r\n\r\nLe secteur de la distribution de produits pétroliers en Afrique de l\'Est bénéficie d\'une demande en croissance régulière, tirée par le développement démographique, l\'urbanisation et les investissements dans les infrastructures routières. Avec un bassin de population supérieur à 200 millions d\'habitants, KenolKobil offre de solides perspectives de développement.\r\n\r\nDepuis 2013, KenolKobil enregistre une croissance régulière de ses volumes et de ses résultats avec un RBE normalisé de 50 millions d\'USD généré en 2017 et présente une structure financière solide.\r\n\r\nÀ 23 KES (Kenyan Shillings) par action, l\'offre de Rubis valorise KenolKobil à 353 millions d\'USD (pour 100 %), financés par les moyens propres du Groupe avec un effet relutif immédiat.\r\n\r\nLe lancement définitif de l\'offre publique est soumis à l\'approbation des autorités régionales et nationales de la concurrence et de toute autre autorité compétente.\r\n\r\n<a href=\"https://rubiskenya.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">KenolKobil</a> correspond parfaitement aux objectifs et critères d\'investissement du Groupe Rubis et viendra idéalement compléter la position de RUBIS ENERGIE en Afrique, dans un secteur particulièrement prometteur où le Groupe entend apporter une nouvelle impulsion.\r\n<p class=\"rteright\"><a href=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/noi-final-artwork-24102018.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Annonce publique : OPA</a></p>\r\n<p class=\"rteright\"><a class=\"target-blank\" href=\"https://rubis.fr/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Groupe Rubis</a></p>'),(13788,1003,'_block_1_fields_text','field_5d318356707db'),(13789,1003,'_yoast_wpseo_primary_category','136'),(13790,1003,'_thumbnail_id','603'),(13792,1003,'post_imgs',''),(13793,1003,'_post_imgs','field_614dc88d40bbc'),(13794,1003,'_dp_original','602'),(13795,1003,'_edit_lock','1635786210:2'),(13796,1003,'_edit_last','2'),(13798,1003,'_wp_old_date','2021-11-01'),(13800,1003,'_wp_old_slug','channel-islands-a-diesel-for-a-greener-future-the-rd100'),(13802,1004,'is_block_prd','0'),(13803,1004,'_is_block_prd','field_60d9cc3911a1c'),(13804,1004,'is_block_map','0'),(13805,1004,'_is_block_map','field_60d9cc5011a1d'),(13806,1004,'block','a:1:{i:0;s:10:\"block.text\";}'),(13807,1004,'_block','field_5d31c1ded5632'),(13808,1004,'header_page_text','VITOGAZ’s commitment to the “GREEN MADAGASCAR” vision, the initiative to see the country again.'),(13809,1004,'_header_page_text','field_60dad748a56be'),(13810,1004,'header_page_color','#4a58c1'),(13811,1004,'_header_page_color','field_60dad74ca56bf'),(13812,1004,'header_page_img','692'),(13813,1004,'_header_page_img','field_60dad753a56c0'),(13814,1004,'header_page',''),(13815,1004,'_header_page','field_60dad72fa56bc'),(13816,1004,'_yoast_wpseo_content_score','90'),(13817,1004,'_yoast_wpseo_estimated-reading-time-minutes','1'),(13818,1004,'_wp_old_date','2021-07-06'),(13819,1004,'_wp_old_date','2021-09-15'),(13820,1004,'_wp_old_date','2021-09-17'),(13821,1004,'_wp_old_date','2021-09-23'),(13822,1004,'block_0_fields_text','February 2021\r\n\r\n<strong>10,000 grounded seedlings, such is the feat achieved by the large family of VITOGAZ Madagascar in Mahajanga and Antananarivo in terms of reforestation for 2021.</strong>\r\n\r\nFor the 5th consecutive year, <strong>VITOGAZ Madagascar</strong> strengthened its commitment to the environment by joining the state’s initiative to see the country again. Thus, the employees and their families, the distributor partners in the 2 cities and the local authorities met in Mahajanga on Saturday 30 January, and in Antananarivo on Saturday 13 February 2021. More than 500 people participated in this action, under the technical direction of the <strong>Regional Directorates of the Ministry of the Environment and Sustainable Development.</strong>\r\n\r\nIndeed, in Madagascar, 50% of forests have disappeared in the last 50 years, at the rate of more than 100,000 ha of forests being destroyed each year, raising fears that the Madagascan Forest will disappear completely over the next ten years. The reason is simple: the energy used by the population is more than 95% wood and coal. More than 400,000 tonnes of coal are consumed annually in Madagascar, with the harmful consequences that this situation entails for the forest.\r\n\r\nSince the end of 2018, VITOGAZ has pursued this approach by offering the market the possibility for the population to buy gas at retail level, from 3,000 ariarys. For VITOGAZ, environmental protection, including commitment to its reforestation programmes and the provision of alternative energy to reduce the use of coal, has become a civic mission. Other promotional, educational and awareness-raising activities are planned throughout the year to extend this mission.'),(13823,1004,'_block_0_fields_text','field_5d318356707db'),(13824,1004,'block_0_fields',''),(13825,1004,'_block_0_fields','field_5d31c477d5643'),(13826,1004,'_wp_old_slug','rubis-energie-en-afrique-de-lest-3'),(13827,1004,'_wp_old_slug','gabon-nouveau-developpement-de-notre-activite-bitume-en-afrique'),(13828,1004,'_wp_old_slug','afrique-du-sud-certification-broad-based-black-economic-empowerment'),(13829,1004,'_yoast_wpseo_title','MADAGASCAR: reforestation operations, VITOGAZ\'s commitment'),(13830,1004,'_yoast_wpseo_metadesc','VITOGAZ’s commitment to the “GREEN MADAGASCAR” vision, the initiative to see the country again.'),(13831,1004,'block_1_fields_text','<strong>Après l\'acquisition de 24,99 % du capital de KenolKobil Plc, le Groupe Rubis annonce ce jour son intention de lancer une offre publique d\'achat sur le capital restant, conformément au règlement applicable à la Bourse de Nairobi, au Kenyan Capital Markets Act ainsi que toutes autres lois et règlements applicables.</strong>\r\n\r\nKenolKobil, leader de la distribution de produits pétroliers au Kenya, est également implanté au Burundi, Éthiopie, Ouganda, Rwanda et Zambie avec un volume global en distribution finale de 1,3million de m3 en 2017.\r\n\r\nKenolKobil regroupe l\'ensemble des activités de distribution de produits pétroliers : réseaux (350 stations-service), carburants aviation, GPL, lubrifiants, bitume, commercial et industriel, avec des accès sécurisés aux oléoducs et son maillage de 10 terminaux.\r\n\r\nLe secteur de la distribution de produits pétroliers en Afrique de l\'Est bénéficie d\'une demande en croissance régulière, tirée par le développement démographique, l\'urbanisation et les investissements dans les infrastructures routières. Avec un bassin de population supérieur à 200 millions d\'habitants, KenolKobil offre de solides perspectives de développement.\r\n\r\nDepuis 2013, KenolKobil enregistre une croissance régulière de ses volumes et de ses résultats avec un RBE normalisé de 50 millions d\'USD généré en 2017 et présente une structure financière solide.\r\n\r\nÀ 23 KES (Kenyan Shillings) par action, l\'offre de Rubis valorise KenolKobil à 353 millions d\'USD (pour 100 %), financés par les moyens propres du Groupe avec un effet relutif immédiat.\r\n\r\nLe lancement définitif de l\'offre publique est soumis à l\'approbation des autorités régionales et nationales de la concurrence et de toute autre autorité compétente.\r\n\r\n<a href=\"https://rubiskenya.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">KenolKobil</a> correspond parfaitement aux objectifs et critères d\'investissement du Groupe Rubis et viendra idéalement compléter la position de RUBIS ENERGIE en Afrique, dans un secteur particulièrement prometteur où le Groupe entend apporter une nouvelle impulsion.\r\n<p class=\"rteright\"><a href=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/noi-final-artwork-24102018.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Annonce publique : OPA</a></p>\r\n<p class=\"rteright\"><a class=\"target-blank\" href=\"https://rubis.fr/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Groupe Rubis</a></p>'),(13832,1004,'_block_1_fields_text','field_5d318356707db'),(13833,1004,'_yoast_wpseo_primary_category','138'),(13834,1004,'_thumbnail_id','692'),(13836,1004,'post_imgs',''),(13837,1004,'_post_imgs','field_614dc88d40bbc'),(13838,1004,'_dp_original','691'),(13839,1004,'_edit_lock','1635786587:2'),(13840,1004,'_edit_last','2'),(13842,1004,'_wp_old_date','2021-11-01'),(13844,1004,'_wp_old_slug','madagascar-reforestation-operations-vitogazs-commitment'),(13845,1004,'_yoast_wpseo_focuskw','Madagascar'),(13846,1004,'_yoast_wpseo_linkdex','43'),(13847,1005,'is_block_prd','0'),(13848,1005,'_is_block_prd','field_60d9cc3911a1c'),(13849,1005,'is_block_map','0'),(13850,1005,'_is_block_map','field_60d9cc5011a1d'),(13851,1005,'block','a:1:{i:0;s:10:\"block.text\";}'),(13852,1005,'_block','field_5d31c1ded5632'),(13853,1005,'header_page_text','Vitogas Spain has supported projects or programmes of general interest.'),(13854,1005,'_header_page_text','field_60dad748a56be'),(13855,1005,'header_page_color','#4a58c1'),(13856,1005,'_header_page_color','field_60dad74ca56bf'),(13857,1005,'header_page_img','772'),(13858,1005,'_header_page_img','field_60dad753a56c0'),(13859,1005,'header_page',''),(13860,1005,'_header_page','field_60dad72fa56bc'),(13861,1005,'_yoast_wpseo_content_score','90'),(13862,1005,'_yoast_wpseo_estimated-reading-time-minutes','1'),(13863,1005,'_wp_old_date','2021-07-06'),(13864,1005,'_wp_old_date','2021-09-15'),(13865,1005,'_wp_old_date','2021-09-17'),(13866,1005,'block_0_fields_text','January 2021\r\n\r\nWe believe it is important to support these associations, which fight on a daily basis for humanitarian purposes.\r\n\r\nThanks to the support of <strong>Rubis Mecenat</strong>, <strong>Vitogas Spain</strong> has supported projects or programmes of general interest. We believe that it is important to support these associations, which fight for humanitarian purposes on a daily basis.\r\n\r\nVitogas staff are involved in this commitment and adhere to this approach. This is why we have renewed the agreements with the “Fundación Aladina”, which is dedicated to supporting children and adolescents with cancer and their families, and with the ACAB (Association Contre l’Anorexie et la Boulimie), which helps and offers support to people with an eating disorder and their families.\r\n\r\nFor the fourth consecutive year, we renewed our agreement with Fundación Aladina, an entity that has just celebrated its fifteenth anniversary with a presence in sixteen hospitals in Spain. During this period, 20,000 children benefited from the aid programme. 2020 was marked by the Covid-19 pandemic, and our financial support will go to an extraordinary support fund that the foundation has set up for children with cancer who have suffered the consequences of Covid-19.\r\n\r\nAt the same time, for the second year in a row, we have validated our confidence in the ACAB, which plans to hire a new psychologist in 2021 to strengthen the family support service. In 2020, our assistance enabled the association to acquire awareness-raising materials for prevention programmes in educational centres.\r\n\r\nWe contribute our modest participation in human projects that bring together the entire team of Vitogas España, and we adopt the quote below as a maxim.\r\n\r\n<strong>“We cannot, under the pretext that it is impossible to do everything in one day, do nothing at all. “Abbé Pierre</strong>'),(13867,1005,'_block_0_fields_text','field_5d318356707db'),(13868,1005,'block_0_fields',''),(13869,1005,'_block_0_fields','field_5d31c477d5643'),(13870,1005,'_wp_old_slug','rubis-energie-en-afrique-de-lest-3'),(13871,1005,'_wp_old_slug','gabon-nouveau-developpement-de-notre-activite-bitume-en-afrique'),(13872,1005,'_wp_old_slug','espagne-vitogas-3eme-edition-festival-montgolfieres'),(13873,1005,'_yoast_wpseo_title','SPAIN: Vitogas supports the Aladina Foundation and the ACAB'),(13874,1005,'_yoast_wpseo_metadesc','Vitogas Spain has supported projects or programmes of general interest. We believe it is important to support these associations, which fight on a daily basis for humanitarian purposes.'),(13875,1005,'block_1_fields_text','<strong>Après l\'acquisition de 24,99 % du capital de KenolKobil Plc, le Groupe Rubis annonce ce jour son intention de lancer une offre publique d\'achat sur le capital restant, conformément au règlement applicable à la Bourse de Nairobi, au Kenyan Capital Markets Act ainsi que toutes autres lois et règlements applicables.</strong>\r\n\r\nKenolKobil, leader de la distribution de produits pétroliers au Kenya, est également implanté au Burundi, Éthiopie, Ouganda, Rwanda et Zambie avec un volume global en distribution finale de 1,3million de m3 en 2017.\r\n\r\nKenolKobil regroupe l\'ensemble des activités de distribution de produits pétroliers : réseaux (350 stations-service), carburants aviation, GPL, lubrifiants, bitume, commercial et industriel, avec des accès sécurisés aux oléoducs et son maillage de 10 terminaux.\r\n\r\nLe secteur de la distribution de produits pétroliers en Afrique de l\'Est bénéficie d\'une demande en croissance régulière, tirée par le développement démographique, l\'urbanisation et les investissements dans les infrastructures routières. Avec un bassin de population supérieur à 200 millions d\'habitants, KenolKobil offre de solides perspectives de développement.\r\n\r\nDepuis 2013, KenolKobil enregistre une croissance régulière de ses volumes et de ses résultats avec un RBE normalisé de 50 millions d\'USD généré en 2017 et présente une structure financière solide.\r\n\r\nÀ 23 KES (Kenyan Shillings) par action, l\'offre de Rubis valorise KenolKobil à 353 millions d\'USD (pour 100 %), financés par les moyens propres du Groupe avec un effet relutif immédiat.\r\n\r\nLe lancement définitif de l\'offre publique est soumis à l\'approbation des autorités régionales et nationales de la concurrence et de toute autre autorité compétente.\r\n\r\n<a href=\"https://rubiskenya.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">KenolKobil</a> correspond parfaitement aux objectifs et critères d\'investissement du Groupe Rubis et viendra idéalement compléter la position de RUBIS ENERGIE en Afrique, dans un secteur particulièrement prometteur où le Groupe entend apporter une nouvelle impulsion.\r\n<p class=\"rteright\"><a href=\"https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/noi-final-artwork-24102018.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Annonce publique : OPA</a></p>\r\n<p class=\"rteright\"><a class=\"target-blank\" href=\"https://rubis.fr/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Groupe Rubis</a></p>'),(13876,1005,'_block_1_fields_text','field_5d318356707db'),(13877,1005,'_yoast_wpseo_primary_ca