-04-18_Floryne_PIERSON.pdf',0,'attachment','application/pdf',0),(1879,0,'2023-05-11 11:38:54','2023-05-11 09:38:54','','Candidature spontanée stage en data science Rubis Energie - Floryne PIERSON','','inherit','open','closed','','candidature-spontanee-stage-en-data-science-rubis-energie-floryne-pierson','','','2023-05-11 11:38:54','2023-05-11 09:38:54','',0,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/files/Candidature-spontanee-stage-en-data-science-Rubis-Energie-Floryne-PIERSON.docx',0,'attachment','application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document',0),(1880,0,'2023-05-12 05:48:59','2023-05-12 03:48:59','','my_odessa','','inherit','open','closed','','my_odessa-5','','','2023-05-12 05:48:59','2023-05-12 03:48:59','',0,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/files/my_odessa-4.pdf',0,'attachment','application/pdf',0),(1881,0,'2023-05-12 05:48:59','2023-05-12 03:48:59','','my_odessa','','inherit','open','closed','','my_odessa-6','','','2023-05-12 05:48:59','2023-05-12 03:48:59','',0,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/files/my_odessa-5.pdf',0,'attachment','application/pdf',0),(1882,0,'2023-05-15 00:00:00','0000-00-00 00:00:00','Rubis Channel Islands est fier de sponsoriser une fois de plus l\'un des plus grands événements de Jersey !</span></h1>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-44e72d34 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" style=\"--flex-direction: initial;--flex-wrap: initial;--justify-content: initial;--align-items: initial;--align-content: initial;--gap: initial;--flex-basis: initial;--flex-grow: initial;--flex-shrink: initial;--order: initial;--align-self: initial;flex-direction: var(--flex-direction);flex-wrap: var(--flex-wrap);justify-content: var(--justify-content);align-items: var(--align-items);align-content: var(--align-content);gap: var(--gap);flex-basis: var(--flex-basis);flex-grow: var(--flex-grow);flex-shrink: var(--flex-shrink);align-self: var(--align-self);--widgets-spacing: 20px;color: var( --e-global-color-text );font-family: \'Open Sans\', sans-serif;font-size: 22px;width: 1060.01px;background-color: #ffffff\" data-id=\"44e72d34\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n	<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n		<p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 10px;padding-bottom: 20px\">\n <span style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-text );font-family: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-family ), Sans-serif;font-size: 10pt;font-weight: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-weight )\">\"Nous sommes ravis de ramener le Jersey International Motoring Festival sur les routes de St. Helier pour une nouvelle année\", a déclaré Steve Salmon, coordinateur de l\'événement JIMF. \"Le festival est une célébration de tout ce qui est formidable dans le domaine de l\'automobile, des voitures classiques aux technologies de pointe. Nous sommes reconnaissants à Rubis de son soutien en tant que sponsor principal de l\'événement, et nous sommes impatients d\'accueillir les passionnés d\'automobile et les spectateurs du monde entier à Jersey pour un week-end d\'événements et d\'activités passionnants.</span>\n		</p>\n		<p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 10px;padding-bottom: 20px\">\n <span style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-text );font-family: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-family ), Sans-serif;font-size: 10pt;font-weight: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-weight )\">Le festival débutera le jeudi 1er juin par une démonstration de sport automobile sur route roulante dans la soirée, suivie d\'un peu de sport automobile. Le vendredi, les visiteurs pourront assister à un sprint au clair de lune sur l\'avenue Victoria, idéal si vous aimez les moteurs bruyants et la vitesse pour vous tenir en haleine !</span>\n		</p>\n		<p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 10px;padding-bottom: 20px\">\n <span style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-text );font-family: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-family ), Sans-serif;font-size: 10pt;font-weight: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-weight )\">Le samedi et le dimanche, la populaire course de côte de Westmount sera à l\'honneur, mais le festival comprendra également l\'Active Arena, très appréciée du public, qui promet d\'être une expérience palpitante pour clôturer l\'événement. Le festival comprendra une variété d\'expositions, y compris des expositions de voitures classiques et anciennes, de motos et de véhicules de course. Les visiteurs auront l\'occasion de rencontrer des propriétaires et des passionnés et d\'en apprendre davantage sur la riche histoire de l\'automobile. En outre, il y aura une série d\'activités pour tous les âges, y compris de la musique en direct, de la nourriture et des boissons, ainsi que des divertissements pour les enfants.</span>\n		</p>\n		<p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 10px;padding-bottom: 20px\">\n <span style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-text );font-family: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-family ), Sans-serif;font-size: 10pt;font-weight: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-weight )\">\"Notre partenariat avec le Jersey International Motoring Festival est la preuve de notre engagement envers la communauté dans laquelle nous travaillons et vivons. Nous sommes extrêmement fiers de participer à un événement aussi dynamique et agréable qui contribue à mettre en valeur la passion du sport automobile dans l\'île. Non seulement le festival offre aux habitants de l\'île la possibilité de montrer leurs talents, mais il constitue également un divertissement et une formidable plateforme pour encourager les visiteurs à venir sur l\'île qui, à leur tour, jouent un rôle essentiel dans le soutien de notre économie locale.</span>\n		</p>\n		<p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 10px;padding-bottom: 20px\">\n <span style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-text );font-family: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-family ), Sans-serif;font-size: 10pt;font-weight: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-weight )\">Le Jersey International Motoring Festival ne peut prospérer que grâce au dévouement inlassable des organisateurs et des bénévoles, et je voudrais remercier tous ceux qui ont contribué à faire de cet événement le succès qu\'il est. Au nom de Rubis Channel Islands, je vous souhaite la bienvenue et j\'espère que vous et vos familles apprécierez tout ce qui est prévu pour le festival de cette année\", a déclaré Alain Carreau (directeur général de Rubis Channel Islands).</span>\n		</p>\n	</div>\n</div>\n <br><span class=\'traut\'>*Traduction automatique</span>','Rubis Channel Islands sponsorise le Jersey International Motoring Festival 2023','','draft','open','open','','','','','2023-05-15 00:00:00','0000-00-00 00:00:00','',0,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/?p=1882',0,'post','',0),(1883,0,'2023-05-15 00:00:00','0000-00-00 00:00:00','Rubis Channel Islands is proud to sponsor one of Jersey\'s largest events, once again!</span></h1>\n</div>\n<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-44e72d34 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" style=\"--flex-direction: initial;--flex-wrap: initial;--justify-content: initial;--align-items: initial;--align-content: initial;--gap: initial;--flex-basis: initial;--flex-grow: initial;--flex-shrink: initial;--order: initial;--align-self: initial;flex-direction: var(--flex-direction);flex-wrap: var(--flex-wrap);justify-content: var(--justify-content);align-items: var(--align-items);align-content: var(--align-content);gap: var(--gap);flex-basis: var(--flex-basis);flex-grow: var(--flex-grow);flex-shrink: var(--flex-shrink);align-self: var(--align-self);--widgets-spacing: 20px;color: var( --e-global-color-text );font-family: \'Open Sans\', sans-serif;font-size: 22px;width: 1060.01px;background-color: #ffffff\" data-id=\"44e72d34\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n	<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n		<p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 10px;padding-bottom: 20px\">\n <span style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-text );font-family: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-family ), Sans-serif;font-size: 10pt;font-weight: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-weight )\">“We are delighted to bring the Jersey International Motoring Festival back to the roads of St. Helier for another year,” said JIMF Event Co-ordinator Steve Salmon. “The festival is a celebration of everything that is great about motoring, from classic cars to cutting-edge technology. We are grateful for Rubis’ support as the title sponsor of the event, and we look forward to welcoming motoring enthusiasts and spectators from around the world to Jersey for a weekend of exciting events and activities.</span>\n		</p>\n		<p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 10px;padding-bottom: 20px\">\n <span style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-text );font-family: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-family ), Sans-serif;font-size: 10pt;font-weight: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-weight )\">The festival will begin on Thursday 1 June, with a rolling roadshow motorsport demonstration in the evening followed by a bit of motorsport. On Friday, visitors can experience the exciting moonlight sprint on Victoria avenue, perfect if you love loud motors, and speed to keep you on your toes!</span>\n		</p>\n		<p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 10px;padding-bottom: 20px\">\n <span style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-text );font-family: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-family ), Sans-serif;font-size: 10pt;font-weight: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-weight )\">While Saturday and Sunday will feature the popular Westmount Hillclimb, the festival will also include the crowd-favourite Active Arena, which promises to be a thrilling experience to end the event. The festival will include a variety of exhibitions, including displays of classic and vintage cars, motorcycles, and racing vehicles. Visitors will have the opportunity to meet owners and enthusiasts and learn about the rich history of motoring. In addition, there will be a range of activities for all ages, including live music, food and drink, and children’s entertainment.</span>\n		</p>\n		<p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 10px;padding-bottom: 20px\">\n <span style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-text );font-family: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-family ), Sans-serif;font-size: 10pt;font-weight: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-weight )\">“Our partnership with the Jersey International Motoring Festival is evidence of our commitment to the community in which we work and live. We are extremely proud to be involved with such a vibrant and enjoyable event which helps to showcase the passion for motorsport in the Island. Not only does the festival provide great opportunities for locals to showcase their talents, but it also provides entertainment and a wonderful platform to encourage visitors to the Island who, in turn, play a vital part in supporting our local economy.</span>\n		</p>\n		<p style=\"margin-top: 0px;margin-bottom: 10px;padding-bottom: 20px\">\n <span style=\"color: var( --e-global-color-text );font-family: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-family ), Sans-serif;font-size: 10pt;font-weight: var( --e-global-typography-text-font-weight )\">The Jersey International Motoring Festival can only thrive following the tireless dedication of the organisers and volunteers, and I would like to thank everyone involved in making this event the success it is. On behalf of Rubis Channel Islands, I welcome you all and hope you and your families enjoy all that is planned for this year’s festival,” said Alain Carreau (Managing Director of Rubis Channel Islands).</span>\n		</p>\n	</div>\n</div>\n <br><span class=\'traut\'>*Automatically translated</span>','Rubis Channel Islands sponsor Jersey International Motoring Festival 2023','','draft','open','open','','','','','2023-05-15 00:00:00','0000-00-00 00:00:00','',0,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/?p=1883',0,'post','',0),(1884,0,'2023-05-16 01:00:04','2023-05-15 23:00:04','','JIMF-2023-.png','','inherit','open','closed','','jimf-2023-png','','','2023-05-16 01:00:04','2023-05-15 23:00:04','',0,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/jimf-2023-png/',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(1885,0,'2023-05-16 11:13:19','2023-05-16 09:13:19','','CV MEHDIBECHAR','','inherit','open','closed','','cv-mehdibechar','','','2023-05-16 11:13:19','2023-05-16 09:13:19','',0,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/files/CV-MEHDIBECHAR.docx',0,'attachment','application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document',0),(1886,0,'2023-05-17 14:52:32','2023-05-17 12:52:32','','HAMZA_CV (1)','','inherit','open','closed','','hamza_cv-1','','','2023-05-17 14:52:32','2023-05-17 12:52:32','',0,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/files/HAMZA_CV-1.pdf',0,'attachment','application/pdf',0),(1887,0,'2023-05-17 14:52:32','2023-05-17 12:52:32','','lettre_de_motivation_hamza (1)','','inherit','open','closed','','lettre_de_motivation_hamza-1','','','2023-05-17 14:52:32','2023-05-17 12:52:32','',0,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/files/lettre_de_motivation_hamza-1.pdf',0,'attachment','application/pdf',0),(1888,0,'2023-05-19 15:15:52','2023-05-19 13:15:52','','CV AMIR VF 2023','','inherit','open','closed','','cv-amir-vf-2023','','','2023-05-19 15:15:52','2023-05-19 13:15:52','',0,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/files/CV-AMIR-VF-2023.pdf',0,'attachment','application/pdf',0),(1889,0,'2023-05-19 15:15:52','2023-05-19 13:15:52','','CV AMIR EN 2023','','inherit','open','closed','','cv-amir-en-2023','','','2023-05-19 15:15:52','2023-05-19 13:15:52','',0,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/files/CV-AMIR-EN-2023.pdf',0,'attachment','application/pdf',0),(1890,0,'2023-05-19 00:00:00','0000-00-00 00:00:00','<p style=\"text-align: justify\">Barcelone, 22 mai 2023- Les installations de Puig-Reig (Barcelone) ont servi de cadre à la convention annuelle de Vitogas Espagne le vendredi 12 mai. Lors de cette réunion, Sebastià Masas, directeur général de l\'entreprise, a présenté les résultats de 2022, en soulignant les étapes les plus importantes franchies, ainsi que les objectifs pour 2023. En plus d\'apprendre les lignes stratégiques pour la nouvelle année, les travailleurs ont participé à une activité ludique de <em>team building</em>, dans le but de promouvoir le travail d\'équipe et de renforcer les relations entre les travailleurs. </p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify\">Il s\'agit du deuxième atelier organisé par l\'entreprise après le succès de la précédente réunion de ses employés. À cette occasion, il a été consacré à l\'une des dernières tendances de ce type dans les entreprises : le Haka Team Building. Le Haka est une danse rituelle maorie qui, par des gestes intimidants et un cri de guerre, vise à transmettre une image de force, de fierté et d\'unité indéfectible de la tribu. Les participants ont exécuté cette danse guerrière avec humour, dans une atmosphère de plaisir, de camaraderie et de cohésion interne. </p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify\">D\'autre part, les participants ont pu découvrir de près les installations de l\'usine de Puig-Reig, grâce à une visite guidée par le département technique. Cette visite a été très utile, en particulier pour les employés qui travaillent au siège de l\'entreprise. </p>\n<p> </p><span class=\'traut\'>*Traduction automatique</span>','L\'usine de Puig-Reig accueille la convention annuelle de Vitogas España','','draft','open','open','','','','','2023-05-19 00:00:00','0000-00-00 00:00:00','',0,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/?p=1890',0,'post','',0),(1891,0,'2023-05-19 00:00:00','0000-00-00 00:00:00','<p style=\"text-align: justify\">Barcelona, May 22, 2023- The facilities of Puig-Reig (Barcelona) were the setting for the annual convention of Vitogas Spain on Friday, May 12. At the meeting, Sebastià Masas, CEO of the company, presented the results of 2022, highlighting the most important milestones achieved, as well as the objectives for 2023. In addition to learning about the strategic lines for the new year, the employees participated in a playful <em>team building</em> activity, with the aim of promoting teamwork and strengthening the relationship between employees. </p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify\">This workshop is the second one held by the company after the success of the previous meeting of its employees. This time it was dedicated to one of the latest trends of this type in companies: the Haka Team Building. The Haka is a Maori ritual dance which, through intimidating body gestures and a war cry, aims to convey an image of strength, pride and unbreakable unity of the tribe. The participants performed the warrior dance with humor in an atmosphere of fun, companionship and internal cohesion. </p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify\">On the other hand, the participants were able to get to know first-hand the facilities of the company\'s plant in Puig-Reig through a guided tour led by the technical department. This visit was very useful, especially for those employees who work at the company\'s headquarters. </p>\n<p> </p><span class=\'traut\'>*Automatically translated</span>','The Puig-Reig plant is the venue for the annual convention of Vitogas España','','draft','open','open','','','','','2023-05-19 00:00:00','0000-00-00 00:00:00','',0,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/?p=1891',0,'post','',0),(1892,0,'2023-05-20 01:00:03','2023-05-19 23:00:03','','Imagen-1.jpg','','inherit','open','closed','','imagen-1-jpg','','','2023-05-20 01:00:03','2023-05-19 23:00:03','',0,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/imagen-1-jpg/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(1893,0,'2023-05-20 01:00:03','2023-05-19 23:00:03','','Imagen-2.jpg','','inherit','open','closed','','imagen-2-jpg','','','2023-05-20 01:00:04','2023-05-19 23:00:04','',1890,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/imagen-2-jpg/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(1894,0,'2023-05-20 01:00:04','2023-05-19 23:00:04','','Imagen-4.jpg','','inherit','open','closed','','imagen-4-jpg','','','2023-05-20 01:00:04','2023-05-19 23:00:04','',1890,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/imagen-4-jpg/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(1895,0,'2023-05-20 01:00:04','2023-05-19 23:00:04','','Imagen-5.jpg','','inherit','open','closed','','imagen-5-jpg','','','2023-05-20 01:00:05','2023-05-19 23:00:05','',1890,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/imagen-5-jpg/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(1896,0,'2023-05-21 19:03:27','2023-05-21 17:03:27','','CV Vincent Bortolussi','','inherit','open','closed','','cv-vincent-bortolussi','','','2023-05-21 19:03:27','2023-05-21 17:03:27','',0,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/files/CV-Vincent-Bortolussi.pdf',0,'attachment','application/pdf',0),(1897,0,'2023-05-22 13:35:58','2023-05-22 11:35:58','','CV_Hugo_MENET','','inherit','open','closed','','cv_hugo_menet','','','2023-05-22 13:35:58','2023-05-22 11:35:58','',0,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/files/CV_Hugo_MENET.pdf',0,'attachment','application/pdf',0),(1898,0,'2023-05-22 13:35:58','2023-05-22 11:35:58','','Lettre_de_Motivation','','inherit','open','closed','','lettre_de_motivation','','','2023-05-22 13:35:58','2023-05-22 11:35:58','',0,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/files/Lettre_de_Motivation.pdf',0,'attachment','application/pdf',0),(1899,0,'2023-05-24 09:36:41','2023-05-24 07:36:41','','CVF Log','','inherit','open','closed','','cvf-log','','','2023-05-24 09:36:41','2023-05-24 07:36:41','',0,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/files/CVF-Log.pdf',0,'attachment','application/pdf',0),(1900,0,'2023-05-24 10:51:57','2023-05-24 08:51:57','','CV Zo','','inherit','open','closed','','cv-zo','','','2023-05-24 10:51:57','2023-05-24 08:51:57','',0,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/files/CV-Zo.pdf',0,'attachment','application/pdf',0),(1901,0,'2023-05-24 10:51:57','2023-05-24 08:51:57','','Scan diplome ingenieur','','inherit','open','closed','','scan-diplome-ingenieur','','','2023-05-24 10:51:57','2023-05-24 08:51:57','',0,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/files/Scan-diplome-ingenieur.pdf',0,'attachment','application/pd