07-08 20:58:03','2023-07-08 18:58:03','',0,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/files/NAGWA-AHMED-KAIREH-cv-2-1.pdf',0,'attachment','application/pdf',0),(1967,0,'2023-07-14 23:40:14','2023-07-14 21:40:14','','Eric Beninga CV2','','inherit','open','closed','','eric-beninga-cv2','','','2023-07-14 23:40:14','2023-07-14 21:40:14','',0,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/files/Eric-Beninga-CV2.pdf',0,'attachment','application/pdf',0),(1968,0,'2023-07-15 00:00:00','0000-00-00 00:00:00','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: normal;background: white\"><span style=\"color: black\">Nous avons le plaisir de partager avec vous la<sup>9e</sup> édition de notre bulletin d\'information Asca Insights et espérons que vous prendrez plaisir à le lire.</span></p><span class=\'traut\'>*Traduction automatique</span>','Bulletin d\'information Asca Insights 9ème édition','','draft','open','open','','','','','2023-07-15 00:00:00','0000-00-00 00:00:00','',0,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/?p=1968',0,'post','',0),(1969,0,'2023-07-15 00:00:00','0000-00-00 00:00:00','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height: normal;background: white\"><span style=\"color: black\">We are pleased to share with you the 9<sup>th</sup> edition of our Newsletter Asca Insights and hope that you will enjoy reading it.</span></p>','Asca Insights Newsletter 9th Edition','','draft','open','open','','','','','2023-07-15 00:00:00','0000-00-00 00:00:00','',0,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/?p=1969',0,'post','',0),(1970,0,'2023-07-16 01:00:03','2023-07-15 23:00:03','','Pix-1.png','','inherit','open','closed','','pix-1-png','','','2023-07-16 01:00:03','2023-07-15 23:00:03','',0,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/pix-1-png/',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(1971,0,'2023-07-18 21:19:00','2023-07-18 19:19:00','','CV M’BODJI Hawa 2023','','inherit','open','closed','','cv-mbodji-hawa-2023','','','2023-07-18 21:19:00','2023-07-18 19:19:00','',0,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/files/CV-MBODJI-Hawa-2023.pdf',0,'attachment','application/pdf',0),(1972,0,'2023-07-18 00:00:00','0000-00-00 00:00:00','<p class=\"MsoNormal\">\n <strong><span style=\"color: red\">Rappel : Ce concours est ouvert à tous les collaborateurs du Groupe, merci de faire passer le message à vos collègues et si possible transmettez la au collaborateur en charge d\'afficher cette information sur vos panneaux d’affichage et dans vos cafétérias. </span></strong>\n</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">\n <strong><span style=\"color: red\">Nous attendons un maximum de participants. N’oubliez pas de nous envoyer vos photos.</span></strong>\n</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">\n	  \n</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">\n <em><span style=\"color: #0070c0\">Chères collaboratrices, chers collaborateurs,</span></em>\n</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">\n <em><span style=\"color: #0070c0\">Enrichir le contenu de nos publications et de notre site internet est un défi permanent. Nous avons sans cesse besoin de nous renouveler et, pour cela, nous avons besoin de vos talents d’artiste car il nous faut également renouveler nos visuels.</span></em>\n</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">\n <strong><em><span style=\"color: #0070c0\">C’est pourquoi Rubis Energie a décidé d’organiser un concours photos, en proposant à l’ensemble de ses collaborateurs et de toutes ses filiales d’y participer.</span></em></strong>\n</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">\n <strong><em><span style=\"color: #0070c0\">Les photos que nous souhaitons recevoir doivent bien évidemment avoir un lien direct ou indirect avec nos métiers, nos produits, nos installations, nos couleurs et nos activités professionnelles, sociales ou sociétales.</span></em></strong>\n</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">\n <em><span style=\"color: #0070c0\">Afin d’effectuer un classement des meilleures photos reçues, nous avons décidé de retenir les critères suivants :</span></em>\n</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 12.0pt\">\n <strong><em><span style=\"color: #0070c0\">L’impact :</span></em></strong><em><span style=\"color: #0070c0\"> c’est le ressenti quand on regarde la photo pour la première fois. Une bonne image peut évoquer la tristesse, la colère, l’orgueil, l’émerveillement ou une autre émotion intense. Dans notre métier, elle peut permettre de valoriser notre image, nos produits, nos services.<br>\n <strong>La technique :</strong> elle concerne la qualité de l’image. On juge l’esthétisme, la netteté, l’exposition, la gestion des couleurs, la lumière.<br>\n <strong>La créativité :</strong> on juge si un message, une idée ou une pensée a été passée.<br>\n <strong>La composition :</strong> on juge comment la photo est conçue. Une bonne composition peut être plaisante ou dérangeante en fonction du message ou de l’émotion que vous avez voulu faire passer.</span></em>\n</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">\n <strong><em><span style=\"color: #0070c0\">Pour participer à ce concours, rien de plus simple ... il vous suffira de nous envoyer vos photos sur l’adresse mail </span></em></strong><span style=\"color: #e03e2d\"><a style=\"color: #e03e2d\" href=\"mailto:concoursphotos@rubisenergie.com\"><strong><em>concoursphotos@rubisenergie.com</em></strong></a></span><strong><em><span style=\"color: #0070c0\">, avant le 31 juillet 2023.</span></em></strong>\n</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">\n <em><span style=\"color: #0070c0\">Alors toutes et tous à vos appareils photo ou smartphones, soyez créatifs et sortez des sentiers battus et des thèmes trop faciles ... faites place à l’imagination !!! Une touche d’humour n’est pas interdite …</span></em>\n</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">\n <em><span style=\"color: #0070c0\">Les lauréats se verront attribuer</span><span style=\"color: red\"> </span><span style=\"color: #0070c0\">:</span></em>\n</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">\n <em><span style=\"color: #0070c0\"><sup>1er</sup>   : Week-end pour 4 personnes en pension complète dans un établissement de haut standing</span></em>\n</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">\n <em><span style=\"color: #0070c0\"><sup>2ème</sup>: Week-end pour 2 personnes en pension complète dans un établissement de haut standing</span></em>\n</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">\n <em><span style=\"color: #0070c0\"><sup>3ème</sup>: Diner / Nuit / Petit déjeuner pour 2 personnes dans un établissement de haut standing</span></em>\n</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">\n <em><span style=\"color: #0070c0\"><sup>4ème</sup> et<sup>5ème</sup>: Déjeuner ou Diner pour 2 personnes dans un établissement de renom</span></em>\n</p><span class=\'traut\'>*Automatically translated</span>','RAPPEL : Rubis Energie organise un concours photos auprès de toutes ses filiales','','draft','open','open','','','','','2023-07-18 00:00:00','0000-00-00 00:00:00','',0,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/?p=1972',0,'post','',0),(1973,0,'2023-07-18 00:00:00','0000-00-00 00:00:00','<p class=\"MsoNormal\">\n <strong><span style=\"color: red\">Reminder: This competition is open to all Group employees. Please pass the message on to your colleagues and, if possible, pass it on to the employee in charge of posting this information on your notice boards and in your cafeterias. </span></strong>\n</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">\n <strong><span style=\"color: red\">We look forward to seeing as many participants as possible. Don\'t forget to send us your photos.</span></strong>\n</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">\n	  \n</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">\n <em><span style=\"color: #0070c0\">Dear employees,</span></em>\n</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">\n <em><span style=\"color: #0070c0\">Enriching the content of our publications and website is a constant challenge. We constantly need to renew ourselves, and for that we need your artistic talents, because we also need to renew our visuals.</span></em>\n</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">\n <strong><em><span style=\"color: #0070c0\">That\'s why Rubis Energie has decided to organize a photo competition, inviting all its employees and subsidiaries to take part.</span></em></strong>\n</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">\n <strong><em><span style=\"color: #0070c0\">The photos we would like to receive must, of course, have a direct or indirect link with our businesses, our products, our facilities, our colors and our professional, social or societal activities.</span></em></strong>\n</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">\n <em><span style=\"color: #0070c0\">In order to rank the best photos received, we have decided to use the following criteria:</span></em>\n</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-bottom: 12.0pt\">\n <strong><em><span style=\"color: #0070c0\">Impact:</span></em></strong><em><span style=\"color: #0070c0\"> this is the feeling you get when you look at the photo for the first time. A good image can evoke sadness, anger, pride, wonder or some other intense emotion. In our business, it can be used to enhance our image, our products and our services.<br>\n <strong>Technical:</strong> this concerns the quality of the image. We judge aesthetics, sharpness, exposure, color management and lighting.<br>\n <strong>Creativity:</strong> we judge whether a message, idea or thought has been conveyed.<br>\n <strong>Composition:</strong> we judge how the photo is designed. A good composition can be pleasant or disturbing, depending on the message or emotion you wanted to convey.</span></em>\n</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">\n <strong><em><span style=\"color: #0070c0\">To take part in this competition, nothing could be simpler... all you have to do is send us your photos to the following e-mail address </span></em></strong><span style=\"color: #e03e2d\"><a style=\"color: #e03e2d\" href=\"mailto:concoursphotos@rubisenergie.com\"><strong><em>concoursphotos@rubisenergie.com</em></strong></a></span><strong><em><span style=\"color: #0070c0\">before July 31, 2023.</span></em></strong>\n</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">\n <em><span style=\"color: #0070c0\">So get out your cameras or smartphones, be creative and think outside the box... let your imagination run wild! A touch of humor is not forbidden..</span></em>\n</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">\n <em><span style=\"color: #0070c0\">The winners will receive</span><span style=\"color: red\"> </span><span style=\"color: #0070c0\">:</span></em>\n</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">\n <em><span style=\"color: #0070c0\"><sup>1st</sup>: Full-board weekend for 4 people in a luxury establishment</span></em>\n</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">\n <em><span style=\"color: #0070c0\"><sup>2nd</sup>: Weekend for 2 people, full board in a luxury hotel</span></em>\n</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">\n <em><span style=\"color: #0070c0\"><sup>3rd</sup>: Dinner / Overnight stay / Breakfast for 2 in a luxury establishment</span></em>\n</p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">\n <em><span style=\"color: #0070c0\"><sup>4th</sup> and <sup>5th</sup>: Lunch or Dinner for 2 in a renowned establishment</span></em>\n</p><span class=\'traut\'>*Automatically translated</span>','REMINDER: Rubis Energie is organizing a photo contest for all its subsidiaries','','draft','open','open','','','','','2023-07-18 00:00:00','0000-00-00 00:00:00','',0,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/?p=1973',0,'post','',0),(1974,0,'2023-07-19 01:00:04','2023-07-18 23:00:04','','Concoursphotos.jpeg','','inherit','open','closed','','concoursphotos-jpeg','','','2023-07-19 01:00:04','2023-07-18 23:00:04','',0,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/concoursphotos-jpeg/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(1975,0,'2023-07-19 01:00:05','2023-07-18 23:00:05','','DSC_4255.jpg','','inherit','open','closed','','dsc_4255-jpg','','','2023-07-19 01:00:07','2023-07-18 23:00:07','',1972,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/dsc_4255-jpg/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(1976,0,'2023-07-19 01:00:07','2023-07-18 23:00:07','','357415996_739940711465967_5598683301253246990_n.jpg','','inherit','open','closed','','357415996_739940711465967_5598683301253246990_n-jpg','','','2023-07-19 01:00:07','2023-07-18 23:00:07','',1972,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/357415996_739940711465967_5598683301253246990_n-jpg/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(1977,0,'2023-07-19 01:00:07','2023-07-18 23:00:07','','Gille