3-08-29 17:33:38','2023-08-29 15:33:38','',0,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/files/CV-alternance-2023.pdf',0,'attachment','application/pdf',0),(2017,0,'2023-08-29 17:33:38','2023-08-29 15:33:38','','Lettre de recommandation','','inherit','open','closed','','lettre-de-recommandation-2','','','2023-08-29 17:33:38','2023-08-29 15:33:38','',0,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/files/Lettre-de-recommandation-1.pdf',0,'attachment','application/pdf',0),(2018,0,'2023-08-30 14:08:16','2023-08-30 12:08:16','','CV détaillé SK Ph 26042023','','inherit','open','closed','','cv-detaille-sk-ph-26042023','','','2023-08-30 14:08:16','2023-08-30 12:08:16','',0,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/files/CV-detaille-SK-Ph-26042023.pdf',0,'attachment','application/pdf',0),(2019,0,'2023-08-31 00:00:00','0000-00-00 00:00:00','<p>Rubis Channel Islands a le plaisir d\'inviter ses clients à un événement d\'entreprise exclusif qui promet d\'être remarquable.</p>\n<p>Le jeudi 14 septembre 2023, de 10h30 à 13h30, Guernesey accueillera un rassemblement spécial à l\'occasion de l\'événement Battle of Britain. Cet événement est l\'occasion d\'honorer le courage et les sacrifices dont a été témoin la bataille d\'Angleterre.</p>\n<p>Le programme de la journée est conçu pour captiver et inspirer. Les impressionnants Red Arrows, connus pour leur précision et leurs acrobaties aériennes audacieuses, vont sillonner le ciel, laissant derrière eux des traces d\'un art vibrant. Le vol commémoratif historique de la bataille d\'Angleterre occupera ensuite le devant de la scène, mettant en scène des avions d\'époque. Rich Goodwin et son Muscle Biplane ajouteront une touche de spectacle audacieux et présenteront une performance à couper le souffle.</p>\n<p>Team Raven, une symphonie de coordination aérienne, fascinera par ses formations complexes, démontrant l\'art du vol synchronisé. Le Bronco OV10, le Seafire et les Titans poursuivront le défilé aérien en présentant un éventail de prouesses aéronautiques. Le crescendo de cet ensemble exaltant sera marqué par un grand défilé aérien d\'un Poseidon de l\'escadron 201.</p>\n<p>Cet événement nous permet de rencontrer nos clients et de tisser des liens avec eux dans un environnement exceptionnel, de sorte que nous puissions continuer à faire des affaires ensemble et, éventuellement, lancer de nouvelles entreprises.</p>\n<p>Surveillez cet espace !</p><span class=\'traut\'>*Traduit automatiquement</span>','Rubis Channel Islands organise un événement d\'entreprise à la Bataille d\'Angleterre à Guernesey','','draft','open','open','','','','','2023-08-31 00:00:00','0000-00-00 00:00:00','',0,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/?p=2019',0,'post','',0),(2020,0,'2023-08-31 00:00:00','0000-00-00 00:00:00','<p>Rubis Channel Islands is thrilled to invite its clients to an exclusive corporate event that promises to be remarkable.</p>\n<p>On Thursday 14th September 2023, 10:30 to 13:30, Guernsey will host a special gathering at the Battle of Britain event. This event offers an opportunity to honour the courage and sacrifices witnessed during the Battle of Britain.</p>\n<p>The day\'s schedule is designed to capticate and inspire. The awe-inspiring Red Arrows, known for their precision and daring aerobatics, are set to grace the skies, leaving trails of vibrant artistry. The historic Battle of Britain memorial flight will then take centre stage, showcasing vintage aircraft. Adding a touch of daring spectacle, Rich Goodwin and his Muscle Biplane are slated to present a heart-pounding performance.</p>\n<p>Team Raven, a symphony of aerial coordination, will mesmerise with their intricate formations, demonstrating the art of synchronised flight. The Bronco OV10, Seafire, and the Titans will continue the airborne parade showcasing a spectrum of aviation prowess. The crescendo of this exhilarating line up will be marked by a grand flypast from a 201 squadron Poseidon.</p>\n<p>This event allows us to meet and network with our clients in an amazing environment so we can continue to conduct further business together and possibly start new ventures.</p>\n<p>Watch this space!</p>','Rubis Channel Islands to hold a corporate event at the Battle of Britain in Guernsey','','draft','open','open','','','','','2023-08-31 00:00:00','0000-00-00 00:00:00','',0,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/?p=2020',0,'post','',0),(2021,0,'2023-09-01 01:00:03','2023-08-31 23:00:03','','Meet-the-Pilots-2023.jpg','','inherit','open','closed','','meet-the-pilots-2023-jpg','','','2023-09-01 01:00:03','2023-08-31 23:00:03','',0,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/meet-the-pilots-2023-jpg/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(2022,0,'2023-09-01 01:00:04','2023-08-31 23:00:04','','Lancaster-Screening.png','','inherit','open','closed','','lancaster-screening-png','','','2023-09-01 01:00:06','2023-08-31 23:00:06','',2019,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/lancaster-screening-png/',0,'attachment','image/png',0),(2023,0,'2023-09-01 17:44:54','2023-09-01 15:44:54','','Baptiste VERVUST CV 2023','','inherit','open','closed','','baptiste-vervust-cv-2023','','','2023-09-01 17:44:54','2023-09-01 15:44:54','',0,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/files/Baptiste-VERVUST-CV-2023.pdf',0,'attachment','application/pdf',0),(2024,0,'2023-09-01 23:01:51','2023-09-01 21:01:51','','Florinda Russo.CV','','inherit','open','closed','','florinda-russo-cv','','','2023-09-01 23:01:51','2023-09-01 21:01:51','',0,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/files/Florinda-Russo.CV_.pdf',0,'attachment','application/pdf',0),(2025,0,'2023-09-01 23:11:41','2023-09-01 21:11:41','','My-CV','','inherit','open','closed','','my-cv','','','2023-09-01 23:11:41','2023-09-01 21:11:41','',0,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/files/My-CV.pdf',0,'attachment','application/pdf',0),(2026,0,'2023-09-01 23:11:41','2023-09-01 21:11:41','','Mydocuments','','inherit','open','closed','','mydocuments','','','2023-09-01 23:11:41','2023-09-01 21:11:41','',0,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/files/Mydocuments.pdf',