www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/files/Curriculum-2023.docx',0,'attachment','application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document',0),(2054,0,'2023-09-19 00:59:45','2023-09-18 22:59:45','','Alternance','','inherit','open','closed','','alternance','','','2023-09-19 00:59:45','2023-09-18 22:59:45','',0,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/files/Alternance.docx',0,'attachment','application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document',0),(2055,0,'2023-09-19 00:59:48','2023-09-18 22:59:48','','Curriculum 2023','','inherit','open','closed','','curriculum-2023-2','','','2023-09-19 00:59:48','2023-09-18 22:59:48','',0,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/files/Curriculum-2023-1.docx',0,'attachment','application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document',0),(2056,0,'2023-09-19 00:59:48','2023-09-18 22:59:48','','Alternance','','inherit','open','closed','','alternance-2','','','2023-09-19 00:59:48','2023-09-18 22:59:48','',0,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/files/Alternance-1.docx',0,'attachment','application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document',0),(2057,0,'2023-09-19 01:01:18','2023-09-18 23:01:18','','Curriculum 2023','','inherit','open','closed','','curriculum-2023-3','','','2023-09-19 01:01:18','2023-09-18 23:01:18','',0,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/files/Curriculum-2023-2.docx',0,'attachment','application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document',0),(2058,0,'2023-09-19 01:01:18','2023-09-18 23:01:18','','Alternance','','inherit','open','closed','','alternance-3','','','2023-09-19 01:01:18','2023-09-18 23:01:18','',0,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/files/Alternance-2.docx',0,'attachment','application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document',0),(2059,0,'2023-09-21 05:39:22','2023-09-21 03:39:22','','CV FATO(1)','','inherit','open','closed','','cv-fato1','','','2023-09-21 05:39:22','2023-09-21 03:39:22','',0,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/files/CV-FATO1.pdf',0,'attachment','application/pdf',0),(2060,0,'2023-09-21 05:39:22','2023-09-21 03:39:22','','DEMANDE FATO','','inherit','open','closed','','demande-fato','','','2023-09-21 05:39:22','2023-09-21 03:39:22','',0,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/files/DEMANDE-FATO.pdf',0,'attachment','application/pdf',0),(2061,0,'2023-09-21 00:00:00','0000-00-00 00:00:00','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: -8.05pt;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Rubis s\'est fixé comme objectif de réduire ses émissions directes (scope 1) et indirectes de gaz à effet de serre liées à l\'achat d\'énergie (scope 2) de 30% d\'ici 2030 par rapport à l\'année de référence 2019. </span><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Les activités de transport maritime du groupe représentent environ la moitié des émissions directes (scope 1). </span>Les équipes concernées de Rubis recherchent des solutions pour atteindre l\'objectif fixé et dans le respect de la cible fixée. Une solution existante qui ne nécessite que peu, voire pas de modification des navires, est la substitution du fioul lourd par du biodiesel. RAME a donc effectué le premier avitaillement de ~ 350 tonnes de B24 le 01/09/2023 dans le port d\'Algeciras pour son navire le BITU ATLANTIC. Le B24 est un mélange de 24% de biodiesel et de 76% de fioul lourd. Le biodiesel utilisé dans ce mélange a été fabriqué à partir d\'huile de cuisson usagée, est certifié durable par l\'organisation ISCC et réduit les émissions de 91% par rapport au fioul lourd qu\'il remplace. Les équipes de Maritec en charge du suivi technique surveilleront les performances du navire utilisant ce nouveau carburant. Si les tests sont concluants, RAME pourra répéter cette opération et entamer ainsi sa trajectoire de réduction de ses émissions directes.</p><span class=\'traut\'>*Traduit automatiquement</span>','Premier avitaillement en B24, un mélange de 24 % de biodiesel et de 76 % de mazout, pour un bitumier de la flotte Rubis Asphalt Middle East (RAME) afin de réduire les émissions de CO2','','draft','open','open','','','','','2023-09-21 00:00:00','0000-00-00 00:00:00','',0,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/?p=2061',0,'post','',0),(2062,0,'2023-09-21 00:00:00','0000-00-00 00:00:00','<p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-right: -8.05pt;text-align: justify;line-height: 1.5\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Rubis has set itself the objective of reducing its direct (scope 1) and indirect greenhouse gas emissions linked to the purchase of energy (scope 2) by 30% by 2030 compared to 2019 reference year. </span><span lang=\"EN-GB\">The group\'s shipping activities represent approximately half of direct emissions (scope 1). </span>The Rubis teams concerned are looking for solutions to meet the set objective and within the set target. An existing solution that requires little, if no modification to the ships, is the substitution of heavy fuel oil with biodiesel. RAME has, therefore, carried out the first bunkering of ~ 350 tonnes of B24 on 01/09/2023 in the port of Algeciras for its ship the BITU ATLANTIC. B24 is a mixture of 24% biodiesel and 76% heavy fuel oil. The biodiesel used in this mixture was made from used cooking oil, is certified sustainable by the ISCC organization and reduces emissions by 91% compared to the heavy fuel oil which it replaces. The Maritec teams in charge of technical monitoring will monitor the performance of the vessel using this new fuel. If the tests are conclusive, RAME will be able to repeat this operation and thus initiate its trajectory of reducing its direct emissions.</p>','First bunkering of B24, a mixture of 24% biodiesel with 76% fuel oil for a bitumen tanker of the Rubis Asphalt Middle East (RAME) fleet to reduce CO2 emissions','','draft','open','open','','','','','2023-09-21 00:00:00','0000-00-00 00:00:00','',0,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/?p=2062',0,'post','',0),(2063,0,'2023-09-22 01:00:03','2023-09-21 23:00:03','','RAME-Picture.jpg','','inherit','open','closed','','rame-pictur