-10-15 08:03:00','',0,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/files/1697356787872_CURRICULUM-VITAE.pdf',0,'attachment','application/pdf',0),(2097,0,'2023-10-15 10:03:00','2023-10-15 08:03:00','','1697356782007_Diploma','','inherit','open','closed','','1697356782007_diploma','','','2023-10-15 10:03:00','2023-10-15 08:03:00','',0,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/files/1697356782007_Diploma.pdf',0,'attachment','application/pdf',0),(2098,0,'2023-10-16 21:31:12','2023-10-16 19:31:12','','CV-TRUFFY-ALEXIS-Anglais-082023','','inherit','open','closed','','cv-truffy-alexis-anglais-082023','','','2023-10-16 21:31:12','2023-10-16 19:31:12','',0,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/files/CV-TRUFFY-ALEXIS-Anglais-082023.pdf',0,'attachment','application/pdf',0),(2099,0,'2023-10-16 23:02:56','2023-10-16 21:02:56','','CV DOUALLA Augustin Jean Mars 2022-1','','inherit','open','closed','','cv-doualla-augustin-jean-mars-2022-1','','','2023-10-16 23:02:56','2023-10-16 21:02:56','',0,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/files/CV-DOUALLA-Augustin-Jean-Mars-2022-1.pdf',0,'attachment','application/pdf',0),(2100,0,'2023-10-16 23:03:00','2023-10-16 21:03:00','','CV DOUALLA Augustin Jean Mars 2022-1','','inherit','open','closed','','cv-doualla-augustin-jean-mars-2022-1-2','','','2023-10-16 23:03:00','2023-10-16 21:03:00','',0,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/files/CV-DOUALLA-Augustin-Jean-Mars-2022-1-1.pdf',0,'attachment','application/pdf',0),(2101,0,'2023-10-16 00:00:00','0000-00-00 00:00:00','<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">REP lance son premier rapport sur la responsabilité sociale de l\'entreprise, dans lequel le personnel et les autres parties prenantes peuvent découvrir notre activité et sa trajectoire au fil des ans, et dans lequel est décrite la stratégie de responsabilité sociale de REP, expliquant comment nous ferons face aux défis qui se présenteront dans les années à venir en termes de durabilité.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Conformément aux objectifs du groupe Rubis, ce rapport présente les engagements pris par REP concernant les piliers de l\'environnement, des personnes et de la société. Ils nous permettront de renforcer les bonnes pratiques de gestion, à travers une performance durable et socialement responsable, contribuant ainsi, à long terme, à la réalisation des Objectifs de Développement Durable.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">Nous pensons que ce document sera utile à tous et incitera le personnel à continuer à travailler ensemble pour une société plus heureuse dans un monde plus durable !</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">Nous vous invitons à consulter le document ci-joint.</p><span class=\'traut\'>*Traduit automatiquement</span>','Rubis Energia Portugal (REP) lance son premier rapport RSE','','draft','open','open','','','','','2023-10-16 00:00:00','0000-00-00 00:00:00','',0,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/?p=2101',0,'post','',0),(2102,0,'2023-10-16 00:00:00','0000-00-00 00:00:00','<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">REP launches its first Corporate Social Responsibility report, in which staff and other stakeholders can discover more about our business and its trajectory over the years and in which is described REP\'s Social Responsibility strategy, explaining how we will face the challenges arising in the coming years in terms of Sustainability.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">In line with the goals of the Rubis Group, this report presents the commitments REP has made regarding the environment, people and society pillars. They will allow us to strengthen good management practices, through sustainable and socially responsible performance, thus contributing, in the long term, to the achievement of the Sustainable Development Goals.</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span lang=\"EN-GB\">We believe this document will prove to be useful for everyone and will incentivise staff to continue working together for a happier society in a more sustainable world!</span></p>\n<p class=\"MsoNormal\">We invite you to have a look in the document attached.</p>','Rubis Energia Portugal (REP) launches its first CSR report','','draft','open','open','','','','','2023-10-16 00:00:00','0000-00-00 00:00:00','',0,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/?p=2102',0,'post','',0),(2103,0,'2023-10-17 01:00:02','2023-10-16 23:00:02','','Relatorio.jpg','','inherit','open','closed','','relatorio-jpg','','','2023-10-17 01:00:02','2023-10-16 23:00:02','',0,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/relatorio-jpg/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(2104,0,'2023-10-18 13:16:15','2023-10-18 11:16:15','','CV','','inherit','open','closed','','cv-4','','','2023-10-18 13:16:15','2023-10-18 11:16:15','',0,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/files/CV-2.pdf',0,'attachment','application/pdf',0),(2105,0,'2023-10-18 13:16:15','2023-10-18 11:16:15','','Lettre de motivation','','inherit','open','closed','','lettre-de-motivation-5','','','2023-10-18 13:16:15','2023-10-18 11:16:15','',0,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/files/Lettre-de-motivation-1.pdf',0,'attachment','application/pdf',0),(2106,0,'2023-10-18 00:00:00','0000-00-00 00:00:00','<p>Barcelone, 18/10/2023- La ville madrilène d\'Aranjuez a accueilli le classique et populaire Festival de ballons d\'Aranjuez les 7 et 8 octobre. L\'événement, organisé par The Air Balloon Company, S.L., a une fois de plus bénéficié de la participation et du parrainage de Vitogas España, fournisseur de gaz propane pour les ballons aérostatiques. </p>\n<p>La Plaza de Parejas, située devant le Palais royal d\'Aranjuez, a été le point de départ de plus d\'une douzaine de montgolfières, qui ont décollé simultanément en deux fois, le samedi matin et l\'après-midi, et en une seule fois le dimanche à huit heures du matin. Le samedi, au coucher du soleil, a eu lieu le spectacle préféré des visiteurs, la Nuit Magique, ou Night Glow, qui a rempli le ciel de montgolfières qui se sont éteintes et ont allumé leurs bougies au rythme de la musique. Malgré un accès limité, l\'événement a attiré plus de 7 000 spectateurs. </p>\n<p>Cet événement, qui a lieu depuis 2004, est le seul festival de montgolfières de la Communauté de Madrid. Lors de sa précédente édition, il a atteint un niveau historique en termes de nombre de visiteurs du site royal et de la ville d\'Aranjuez, qui a été dépassé cette année et qui devrait encore augmenter lors des prochaines éditions. </p>\n<p> </p><span class=\'traut\'>*Traduit automatiquement</span>','Le ballon Vitogas revient dans le ciel d\'Aranjuez','','draft','open','open','','','','','2023-10-18 00:00:00','0000-00-00 00:00:00','',0,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/?p=2106',0,'post','',0),(2107,0,'2023-10-18 00:00:00','0000-00-00 00:00:00','<p>Barcelona, 10/18/2023- The Madrid town of Aranjuez hosted last October 7 and 8 the classic and popular Aranjuez Balloon Festival. The event, organized by The Air Balloon Company, S.L., counted again with the participation and sponsorship of Vitogas Spain, propane gas supplier of the aerostatic balloons. </p>\n<p>The Plaza de Parejas, located in front of the Royal Palace of Aranjuez, was the starting point for more than a dozen hot air balloons, which performed simultaneous takeoffs in two shifts on Saturday morning and afternoon, and a single shift on Sunday at eight o\'clock in the morning. On Saturday, at sunset, came the visitors\' favorite show, the Magic Night, or Night Glow, which filled the sky with hot air balloons that extinguished and lit the candles to the rhythm of the music. Despite the limited access, this activity gathered more than 7,000 spectators. </p>\n<p>The event, which has been held since 2004, is the only hot air balloon festival in the Community of Madrid, and in its previous edition reached a historic milestone of tourist inflow to the Real Sitio y Villa de Aranjuez, which has been surpassed this year and expects further growth in future editions. </p>\n<p> </p><span class=\'traut\'>*Automatically translated</span>','The Vitogas balloon returns to the sky of Aranjuez','','draft','open','open','','','','','2023-10-18 00:00:00','0000-00-00 00:00:00','',0,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/?p=2107',0,'post','',0),(2108,0,'2023-10-19 01:00:02','2023-10-18 23:00:02','','Imagen1.jpg','','inherit','open','closed','','imagen1-jpg','','','2023-10-19 01:00:02','2023-10-18 23:00:02','',0,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/imagen1-jpg/',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(2109,0,'2023-10-19 20:07:32','2023-10-19 18:07:32','','Screenshot_20231013-105249_OneDrive','','inherit','open','closed','','screenshot_20231013-105249_onedrive','','','2023-10-19 20:07:32','2023-10-19 18:07:32','',0,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/files/Screenshot_20231013-105249_OneDrive.jpg',0,'attachment','image/jpeg',0),(2110,0,'2023-10-21 15:17:43','2023-10-21 13:17:43','','CV AHD','','inherit','open','closed','','cv-ahd','','','2023-10-21 15:17:43','2023-10-21 13:17:43','',0,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/files/CV-AHD.docx',0,'attachment','application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document',0),(2111,0,'2023-10-21 15:17:43','2023-10-21 13:17:43','','Scan1','','inherit','open','closed','','scan1','','','2023-10-21 15:17:43','2023-10-21 13:17:43','',0,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/files/Scan1.pdf',0,'attachment','application/pdf',0),(2112,0,'2023-10-21 15:23:20','2023-10-21 13:23:20','','CV AHD','','inherit','open','closed','','cv-ahd-2','','','2023-10-21 15:23:20','2023-10-21 13:23:20','',0,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/files/CV-AHD-1.docx',0,'attachment','application/vnd.openxmlformats-officedocument.wordprocessingml.document',0),(2113,0,'2023-10-21 15:23:20','2023-10-21 13:23:20','','Scan1','','inherit','open','closed','','scan1-2','','','2023-10-21 15:23:20','2023-10-21 13:23:20','',0,'https://www.rubisenergie.com/uploads/files/Scan1-1.pdf',0,'attachment','application/pdf',0),(2114,0,'2023-10-22 20:29:30','2023-10-22 18:29:30','','CV Sébastien Barlagne Officiel','','